  <para style="h">Tujila Giesan Wilie</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tujila Giesan Wilie</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tujila</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tuj</para>
  <para style="mt">Tujila Giesan Wilie</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Shenlinni Saghei Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1-2"/>
    <char style="pn">Qiafeilo</char> noyen, bi melieshiku shu jiere <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wilie giezhi qiisanse sunghusan shitulade Shenlinghala fenfulasenu asiman jiere khireiku hhe udu kurutula hhe giesan, surughasanlai man huaiwo. <verse eid="ACT 1:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> ku shouidene olon zhenjighala goya aminne oluwo giezhi shitulade uzheghawo. 40 qien dunda shitulade xienjighazhi Hudai gojiai shiqinyi jianjizho. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> hhelare hhantulakude fenfulazhi kieliewo, "Ta <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se likai bu giezhi bi tande kieliesan mutun Ada dain giesei saghei. <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/><char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> usughala xili gieghawoma, giedudu ulie beizhi tai Shenlinghala xili gieghane."<verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ersa Asiman Jiere Khireiwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Hhela man hhantu bikude <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de asawo, "Ezhan, chi ene shihoude <char style="png">Isilie</char> gojiani yen goudaghanu?" <verse eid="ACT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char> hhelade kieliewo, "Ada qienlighalane jinjisan shihou, uduni ta mejiekuni pushoma, <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Shenlin tai jiere bouzhese tande nenli irezhi ta <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>, <char style="png">Yudaya</char>, <char style="png">Samaliya</char>, pse duyai uzhude kutula made ganzhen beine." <verse eid="ACT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Ene kielienyi kielie baraghadene hhela uzheku shihoude asiman jiere khireiwo. Niegieda olien hhei jienlie echise chanla dawo. <verse eid="ACT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Hhe khireikude hhela asiman jiere xianxide uzhese menzhali ghua chighan jien musisan kun hhelai kanzide beizhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>"<char style="png">Jialili</char> kunla, ta yale beizhi asimanyi uzhene? Tanse likai giezhi asiman jiere khireisan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>, ta matugie uzhezhi khireighazhoshi yen qingiezhi irene."<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Maqiyani Shitu Sunghuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Ingiedene hhela <char style="png">Ganlanshan</char>se <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khareiwo. <char style="png">Ganlanshan</char> <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se chada wo, hhamuraku udude yose olune. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Hhela chenshide orodene sousan lou jierene khireiwo. Hhende <char style="pn">Beduru</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>, <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>, <char style="pn">Andelie</char>, <char style="pn">Feili</char>, <char style="pn">Doma</char>, <char style="pn">Badolomai</char>, <char style="pn">Matai</char>, <char style="pn">Yalefei</char>ni kewon <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>, Rexinpaini <char style="pn">Ximun</char>, <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>ni kewon <char style="pn">Yuda</char> enela wine. <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Enezighan kunla, giedun bierei, <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni anani <char style="pn">Mereiyen</char>, gaijiulareni hhantu hende onxian giezho.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Hhe oloncha chabudu 120 gie gaijiula hhantulakude <char style="pn">Beduru</char> bosizhedene kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>"Gaijiula, jinwun jiere Shenlin <char style="pn">Dawude</char>i amanghala melieshi kieliesan mutun <char style="pn">Yuda</char> kunlai uduruzhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i bareiku shiqin zhao hhe mutun gholuse indanji wo. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Hhe yenlaishi matanyi dundashiku nie wo. Shitula gieku wiliese ibufen zhanjizho. <verse eid="ACT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Ene nie kun gou wiku baerghala nie ghazha agiwo. Ingie ghazhadene fura bou, kielini gha oluzhi khizhesunlani usuru khizhezho. <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/><char style="pn">Yelusalen</char>de sousan kunla ene shiqinni man mejiewo. Ingie goyalane kielienghala ghazhaini <char style="png">Yagedama</char> giewo. Isishi chusun ghazha wo. <verse eid="ACT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>Enei <char style="bk">Zeburei</char> jiere ingiezhi kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">'Hhei sousan oronni honji gholuzhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">kiemai ulie soughasejiu.'</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Pse kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">'Danie kunyi hhei oronde jinjighasejiu.'<verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22"/>Ingiese Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> matanyi dunda giekude <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> xili gieghasanse Ezhan matanse likai giezhi asiman jiere khitula matanre chan hhantu bisan kun dundase nie sunghuzhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> fuho giesande ganzhen beighakui wo."<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Ingiedene hhela sunghune giezhi ghua kunyi khizheghawo. Nieshi <char style="pn">Yusufu</char> wo. Hhei <char style="pn">Basaba</char>ye giene, <char style="pn">Yushidu</char> giezhiye uruzho. Da nieshi <char style="pn">Maqiya</char> wo. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24-25"/>Hhela onxian giezhi kieliewo, "Ezhan, chi kunlai zhughei man mejiene. Chi ene ghua kunse kienyi sunghuzhi ene shituni wiliei giekui bijiende mejiegha. <char style="pn">Yuda</char> ene wiliei bendadene goya orondene echiwo." <verse eid="ACT 1:24-25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Ingie hhela fendan qiangudene <char style="pn">Maqiya</char>ni choui khizhewo. Hhei 11 gie shitulare hhantulaghawo.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s">50 Qienni Jieqide Shenlin Bouzhezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>50 qienni jieqi kuzhese hhela man nie oronde hhantulazho. <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Menzhali asiman jierese fugie kei feiliesan mutun nie xianshen bouzhezhi hhela sousan giedera duruwo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Pse khanni hoyen mutun khizhedene jien kunyi jiere luiwo. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Ingie hhelai jiere Shenlin durudene Shenlin ogisan nenlighala psedu kielienghala kielie qiiwo.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Hhe xienzide xienliantu <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla shijieni go gojiase irezhi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de souzho. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Ene shenqi khizhese olon kunla man hhantuladene goya oronyi kielienyi sonosuse ghudure wo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>Hhela hende ghanirazhi kieliewo, "Uzhe, ene kielien kieliesanlashi <char style="png">Jialili</char> kun pushonu? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Matan chenliese hhela matugie mai olusan oronyi kielienghala kieliezho? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Mai dunda <char style="png">Paqiya</char>, <char style="png">Madai</char>, <char style="png">Ilan</char> kun wine. Pse <char style="png">Meisobudamiya</char>, <char style="png">Yudaya</char>, <char style="png">Jiapadojia</char>, <char style="png">Bendu</char>, <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/><char style="png">Fulijia</char>, <char style="png">Panfeiliya</char>, <char style="png">Aiji</char>dedu kun, <char style="png">Gulinai</char>ni kouisan <char style="png">Libiya</char>i idou oronni kunlaye wine. Da <char style="png">Loma</char>se irezhi toreisan kun dunda <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, Yutaijioni suisan kun wine. Pse <char style="png">Kelite</char>, <char style="png">Alabo</char> kunye wine. Matan sonosuse hhela mai kielienghala Hudai fugie shiqinyi kieliezho." <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Kunla man ghanirazhi mejie dazhi nieniedene, "Eneshi yan isi wo?" giezhi asazho. <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Niezhan kunla hhelai xiniezhi hhela jiu ochi sudowo giezho.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beduru Kunlade Jianjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> 11 gie shitulare bosi ire kunlade fugiede kieliewo, "<char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de sousan kunla, bi kieliesei goude chenliezhi mejiendu. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Ta sumulase enezighan kunla sudowo giezhou? Uye sudozho, eneshi eqiemaghaku 9 jien wo. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Eneshi zhen xienzhi <char style="pn">Yeer</char> kieliezhi daosan wo,<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>'Huda kieliewo, Duya baraku xienzide</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">bi Shenlinne jien kunlai jiere kiene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:17">Tai kewon, oqinla mini kielienyi kieliene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Tai nasuchighan kunla zhoujin mutun chanlane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Tai oqio kunla zhoujin zhoujiliene.<verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Hhe xienzi kuzhese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">bi Shenlinne ere kun, bierei hojilane jiere kiese</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">hhela mini kielienyi kunlade kieliene.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Asiman jiere bi fugie shiqin xienjighane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Zemin jiere chusun, khan, funighala ghudureqi xienjighane.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Ezhanni fugie famatu udu kuzhetula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">naran kharalane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">sara chusun mutun hularane.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Ingiese Ezhanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">xiahua giesan kunlai man jiuine.'"<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>"<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla, ene kielienyi chenliendu. Huda <char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi tai dunda nenlitu shiqin, fugie shiqin, ghudureqi xienjighadene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de ganzhen beizho. Enei ta goyalane mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Huda zhao goyane isighala melieshi jihua giesan mutun <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i jiuizhi ogiwo. Ta niman doghun kunlai tungo giezhi hhei shizijia jiere ghada alawo. <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Ingieliuzhe Huda hhei fuguku nangoni widaghazhi aminne olughawo. Fuguku hhei hanshilie dazho. <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/><char style="pn">Dawude</char> hhei zhiizhi kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">'Bi chanlase Ezhan chan mii shida wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Hhe mii borun miende beise bi ulie gojiolune.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Ingiese zhughedemi bayasuzhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">amandemi doulakui wine.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:26">Made xiwon wine, bi hhamura shidane.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Chi mii ruhherni dozode ulie bendane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Zhiguitu kunne ulie fughane.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Chi aminni moni made uzheghawo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Chighala hhantushi bi hende bayasuzho.'"<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>"Gaijiula, famatu xienren <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni shiqinyi bi tande minminji kielieye. Hhe duya ijiezhi bulawo. Hhei meza edeliuzhe mai enende wine. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Hheshi nie xienzhi wo. Huda hhende dadu giezhi hhei houdeise nie kun sunghudene hhei baozo jiere soughane giezhi kieliesei mejiewo. <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Hhe melieshidase ene shiqinyi mejiezhi Mexiha fuho giekui kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:31">'Hhei dozode ese bendawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:31">beyeini ese fughawo.'<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>Ene nie <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i Huda aminne olughawo. Bijien man ene shiqinde ganzhen beine. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Huda hhei undudaghazhi borun miendene soughawo. Ada dain giesan Shenlinni hhe jienliedene kie bouzheghawo. Eneshi ta chujieghezhi sonosusan wo. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34-35"/><char style="pn">Dawude</char> asiman jiere ese khireiwoma, goyane kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34-35">'Ezhan mii Ezhande kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">"Bi duitoulaichii kon dourachii teitula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">chi mini borun miende sou."'<verse eid="ACT 2:34-35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>Ingiese <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla, man mejiendu. Ta shizijia jiere ghadasan ene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni Huda Ezhan, yeshijiu Mexiha gholughawo."<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Kunla ene kielienyi chenliedene zhughedeni hende jindazhi <char style="pn">Beduru</char>de, psedu shitulade asazho, "Gaijiula, bijien matugiene?"<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "Ta man geizhen giendu. <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai niereghala xilii jienliedene tai zuini mienlie gie. Ingiese Huda ogine giesan Shenlinni ta jienliene. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Ene dainshi tande, tai kesilade, pse Ezhan mai Huda gholodose uruzhi iresan kunlade man olusan wo."<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> pse olon kielienghala, "Ta ene idai doghun kunlai dundase goyalane jiuizhi khizhe!" giezhi ganzhen beizhi hhelade hende surughazhi kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Hhei kielienyi xianxin giesan kunla xili jienliewo. Hhe niudude xianxin giesan kun chabudu 3000 olodowo. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Hhela zhomen shitula sughasanyi chenliezhi laiwon giezhi ginan ghuluzhi onxian gienduzho.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xianxin Giesan Kunla Laiwon Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Shitula olon fugie shiqin, ghudureqi xienjighase kunla man ayizho. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Xianxin giesan kunla hhantulazhi yan dunxiiliuzhe hhantu injizho. <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Hhela giene dunxi, jiachanlane huidene baer injine giesan kunlade ghughazhi ogizho. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Niudunie mechide hhantulazho. Pse gieladene ginan ghuluzhi bayasuzhi heqide ijienduzho. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Hudade doulazho. Olon kunla hhelai kuaizho. Ezhan yebeiseye kun olon jiuizho.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Beduru Dogholonyi Goudaghawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Niudude xiawu 3 jienni onxian gieku shihoude <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala mechide echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Niekozi kun olusanse dogholon wo. Niudunie kunla qienliezhi mechii wijien konde teizhi wijiense orochen kunlase xiahua giezhi baer ghuizho. Hhe wijienyi nierei <char style="png">Seighan wijien</char> giene. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Hhe kun <char style="pn">Beduru</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala orokui chanladene xiahua giezhi baer kerezho. <verse eid="ACT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala hhei xianxide uzhedene <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "Chi bijienyi uzhe." <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Hhe kun hhelai xianxide uzhezhi sumulase yama kerene giezho. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "Made antan, miengu uwoma, bikune chade ogiye. Bi <char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai niereghala kielieye, 'Chi bosidene yo!'" <verse eid="ACT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Ingiedene hhei borun khase feizhi bosizheghawo. Hhei gugieni, konni deigo goudazhi lilian orowo. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Jiuli bosi ire, beidene yo qiiwo. Hhelare hhantu mechide orokude yozho, jiulizho, Hudade doulazho. <verse eid="ACT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>Kunla hhe yozhi Hudade doulasanyi chanlawo. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Hheshi mechini <char style="png">Seighan wijien</char> konde sousan ghuichen bikuni mejiedene hhe goudasan shiqinde ghaniradei uzhe beizho.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beduru Sulumaneni Zoulan Doura Jianjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Hhe kun <char style="pn">Beduru</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghalai barei beikude olon kunla holuzhi hhende ire ghanirawo. Hheshi zhen <char style="pn">Sulumane</char>ni zoulan doura wo. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> chanladene bexinlade kieliewo, "<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla, ta yale ene shiqinde ghanirazho? Ta bijienyi yangiezhi uzhezho? Ta sumulase bijien goya nenli, xienliantu zhugheghalane ene kunyi yoghawo giezhou? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/><char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>, <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>, <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>i Huda, mai xienrenlai Huda goya hoji <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i kuaizho. Ene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi ta <char style="pn">Bilado</char>de jiuizhi ogidene <char style="pn">Bilado</char> jiejin giezhi hhei andaghane giese ta fandui giesan hhe wo. <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Ta zhiguitu, gou kunyi ulie keredene kun alasan kunyi andagha giezhi xiahua giewo. <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>Ta alasanshi aminni Ezhan wo. Huda hhei fugusan kun dundase aminne olughawo. Bijien ene shiqinde ganzhen beine. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Ta tanizhi chanlasan ene kunde <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niere lilian oroghawo. <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin gieku xinyanghala ene kunyi tai melie qienbu goudaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>Gaijiula, ta noyenlane mutun mejie dazhi qingiezhi giesei bi mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Huda eqighanse jien xienzhilani tungo giezhi Mexiha shouku giekui kieliewo. Ede qimutui gholuwo. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Ingiese ta geizhen giezhi Hudai miende khareizhi irendu. Tai zuini widaghane. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Ingiese futanni shihou Ezhanyi hhense irene. Huda eqighanse jinjisan Mexihai tande oluzhi ireghane. Hheshijiu <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Zhen Huda eqighandei zhiguitu xienzhilane tungo giezhi kieliesan mutun duyani cunxin goudaghaku shihou olutula <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha bixi asiman jiere feiliene. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> kieliezhi Ezhan Huda tai dundase bi mutun nie xienzhi khizheghane. Hhe yan kieliese ta man chenliendu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Kien ene xienzhii kielienyi ulie chenliese Huda bexinlane dundase widaghane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/><char style="pn">Samuer</char>se kaishi giezhi hhei khuinadedu alinie xienzhiliuzhe ene udulani shiqinyi kieliezhi daowo. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Tashi hhe xienzhilai houdei wo. Huda tai xienrenlade yenjisan kielienni taye jienliewo. Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de ingie kielie goudaghazho, 'Zemin jieredu soyuji minzulade chii houdeini yenyinzhe fuqi irene.' <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Huda hojine bosizheghadene peizhi xien tande iregha, tai alinie kunniliuzhe doghunnilase likai gieghazhi tande fuqi ogiwo."<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Beduru Yaheiyaghalai Bareidene Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala kunlade kielien kieliekude buwala, mechii sagheisan duizhan, Sadugai kunla iredene <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>hhela bexinlade <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tungo giezhi fugusan kun fuho giesei surughazhi chonjise hende hokuzho. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Ingie hhelai barei agi, khara oluse khadene khuichudu kuwo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Ingieliuzhe hhela jianjisan kielienni chenliedene xianxin giesan kun olon wo. Xianxin giesan ere kun 5000 gholuwo.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Khuichudu <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni noyen, zhanlao, jinwun hanjiala man <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de hhantulawo. <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Zui fugie buwa <char style="pn">Yanasi</char>, <char style="pn">Gaiyafa</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>, <char style="pn">Yalishanda</char>, pse zui fugie buwani jiawuni kunla man hhende wine. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Hhela <char style="pn">Beduru</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghalai dunda beighadene asawo, "Ta kienyi nenli, niereghala ene shiqinyi giezho?" <verse eid="ACT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Qingiekude <char style="pn">Beduru</char>de Shenlin duruzhi hhelade kieliewo, "Bexinlai noyen, zhanlaolaya, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>ta enedu ene dogholonyi jiere bijien giesan gou shiqin, pse hhe matugie goudasei bijiende asazhoshi <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>ta ashighala, <char style="png">Isilie</char>ni bexinla man mejiendu. Tai melie beizhi goudasan ene kunshi ta shizijia jiere ghadadene Huda fugusan kun dundase aminne olughasan <char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani niereghala goudaghasan wo. <verse eid="ACT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>Ene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi jinwunde ingiezhi kieliesan hhe wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">'Ta jianrenla bendasan tashi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ede giei zhunyo tashi gholuwo.'<verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>
    <char style="pn">Ersa</char>se chugo pse jiuichen uwo. Qienxiade matanyi jiuiku psedu nierei ese ogizho."<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Hhela <char style="pn">Beduru</char>, <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> ghuala fugie danzighala kieliesei uzhewo. Hhelade yama unhua wikui mejiedene ghanirawo. Pse ene ghua kunshi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>re hhantuku wo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Hhe goudasan kun hhelare hhantu beisanyi chanladene hhelade yama kielieku kielien widawo. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>i zui fugie fayense khireigha giezhi fenfuladene goyalane shanlian giezhi kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>"Matan ene ghua kunyi matugiene? Hhela nie ghudureqi xienjighawo, jien <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de sousan kunla man mejiene. Matan uwo giezhi kielie danema, <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>ene shiqin bexinlai dunda fugiedakuse ayizhi matan hhelai nie ayighaye. Ene kunyi niereghala pse bu chonji gie."<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Ingie hhe ghualai uruzhi ire, <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni niereghala kunlade pse bu jianji, ye bu surugha giewo. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala kieliewo, "Tai kieliei chenlie, Hudai kieliei ulie chenliese, Hudai melie heshi winu uwo? Ta goyalane sumula. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Bijien chujieghezhi sonosusanne ulie kieliezhi ulie olune."<verse eid="ACT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Noyenla hhelade yama faikui jiekou ereizhi khizhe dawo. Pse bexinla ene fashen giesan shiqin jiere Hudai kuaise hhe ghualai hende nie ayigha andaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Yenlai ene ghudureqighala goudaghasan kun 40 ji olune.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tujila Danzii Fugiedagha Giezhi Onxian Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghalai andaghadene hhela goya kunlane hhende echiwo. Fugie buwa, zhanlaolai kieliesan kielienyi goya kunladene kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Hhela chenliedene Hudade nie zhugheghala fugiede kieliewo, "Asiman, zemin, hai, pse hhei sudorodu shihenilai man zhayaghazhi gonjisan Ezhan, <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>chi Shenlinyi tungo giezhi goya hojine, bijienyi xienren <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni amanghala ingiezhi kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">'Go gojiala yale nouine?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Go minzula yale oronde wikui jihua giene?<verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Duyai honshanla bosizhewo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Noyenla hhantulazho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">Ezhanse, Ezhanni Mexihase fandui giene giezho.'<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>
    <char style="pn">Hherode</char>, <char style="pn">Benjiu-Bilado</char> ghuala ene chenshide niman kun, <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlare hhantuladene chi sunghu goudaghasan zhiguitu hoji <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i qingiezhi fandui giezho. <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Hhela giesanlashi man chii nenli, isighala eqighan jiejin giesan shiqin wo. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Ezhan, hhela ede bijienyi ayighasei chi nie uzhe. Hojiladene fugie danzi ogizhi chii kielienni kieliegha. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Chi nenline xienjighazhi gienlai goudagha. Chii zhiguitu hoji <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala ghudureqi, fugie shiqin xienjigha."<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Hhela onxian gie baluse hhantulasan oron gojiolu qii, hhelade man Shenlin duruzhi danzine fugiedagha, Hudai kielienni kielie qiiwo.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yan Dunxiiliuzhe Hhantu Injizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Xianxin giesan kunla zhughede, sumulasanla man nie wo. Kienliuzhe eneshi goyanughun wo ulie giene, man hhantu injizho. <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Shitula fugie nenlighala Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> fuho giesande ganzhen beizho. Ingiese kunlade Hudai fugie nenjien irewo. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Hhelai dunda kiemade yama ese chaizho. Hhela ghazha, gielane huisan baerni agizhi iredene <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>shitulani melie jiese shitula zhao kunla injiku mutun ghughazhi ogiwo.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Nie <char style="png">Liwi</char> kunyi nierei <char style="pn">Yusufu</char> giene. <char style="png">Saipulusi</char>de oluzho. Shitula hhei <char style="pn">Banaba</char> giezhi uruzho, isishi kunlade goude sughazhi kieliechen wo. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Hhe ghazhalane huidene baerni agizhi ire shitulai melie jiewo.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yananiya Safeila Ghuala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Da nie kunyi nierei <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> giene. Biereiini <char style="pn">Safeila</char> giene. Ghuala ghazhane huidene <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>baerse ghulazhi goyadene gouji feiliegha, psedulai shitulai melie jiewo. Enei biereiniye mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Yananiya</char>, yale chii zhughede Ibilisi duruzhi Shenlinyi piendane? Ghazhane huisan baerni yale goujinie feilieghawo? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Ghazhane uye huikude ghazhashi chinughun pushonu? Ede huise baerne chi zozhu giezhola? Chi yale intui giezho? Chi kunni ese piendazho. Hudai piendazho." <verse eid="ACT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/><char style="pn">Yananiya</char> ene kielienyi chenliedene fura bou, ho sirawo. Chenliesan kunla man hende ayizho. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Giedun nasuchighan kunla bosi ire, hhei boui goudaghadene qienlie khirei bulawo.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Ghuran zhuntou daose biereini irewo. Ene shiqinni dou ulie mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> hhende asawo, "Chi made kielie, ta ghazha huisan baershi enezighan onu?" "Jiu enezighan wo."<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "Ta ghuala yale hhantulazhi Ezhanni ruhherni shiine? Zhanguijii chii bulasan kunla ede wijien konde irewo, chiiye qienlie khighane."<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Ingie hhe bierei deigo <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i kon konde fura bou, ho sirawo. Hhe nasuchighan kunla oro ire fuguseini chanladene, qienlie echi zhanguijiini kanzide bulawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Jien jiohuini kunla, pse ene shiqinyi chenliesan kunla man hende ayizho.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shitula Ghudureqi Xienjighazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Ezhan shitulai tungo giezhi bexinlai dunda ghudureqi, fugie shiqin olon giewo. Xianxin giesan kunla <char style="png">Sulumane</char> zoulande heqide man hhantulazho. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Bexinla man hhelai zanchen giezhoma, kunlase ayizhi hhelare hhantula dazho. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Ezhanyi xianxin giesan ere kun, biereila yebeiseye olodozho. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Niezhan kunla da gientulai qienliezhi geidoude khirei chon, ruzi jiere jiezho. Sumulase <char style="pn">Beduru</char> yozhi daokude xiujieniliuzhe hhelai jiere kuse giezho. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Pse <char style="png">Yelusalen</char> zhouwini xianlase olon kunla gientu, zannan ruhher heisanlai uduru ire man goudaghawo.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shitulai Biizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Zui fugie buwa, hhei lienshoulani Sadugai kunla hende dubiliedene <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>shitulai barei agi bafanzide khawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Xienidei Ezhanyi qienxien bafanzi wijienyi niezhi hhelai uduru khizhegha kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>"Ta mechide echidene ene amin ogiku daolii bexinlade man kielie." <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Ingiese shitula ene kielienyi chenliedene ogheikude mechide echizhi kunlade sughazho. Zui fugie buwa, lienshoularene kuzhedene zui fugie fayenni kun, <char style="png">Isilie</char>ni zhanlaolai uruzhi irewo. Kun peizhi bafanzise shitulai lai iregha giezho. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Mechini sagheisan kunla bafanzide echise kun nieda uwo. Ingie khareizhi ire kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>"Bijien echise bafanzi wijien yama ese giezho. Sagheisan kun wijien ghadane wo. Wijienyi niese sudoro kun nieda uwo." <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Mechini sagheisan duizhan, fugie buwa ene kielienyi chenliedene ghanirazhi matugie imutui gholuwo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Nie kun iredene kieliewo, "Ta bafanzide bareisan kunla ede mechide beidene bexinlade sughazho." <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Ingie duizhan mechini sagheisan kunlai uduruzhi shitulai barei irewo. Bexinla hhelai tashighala eghikuse ayizhi khidunde ese giezho.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Hhela shitulai barei ire zui fugie fayen sudoro beigha zui fugie buwa hhelade asazho, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>"Bijien tande hende jingao giezhi ene kunyi niereghala kunlai bu surugha giezhi kieliewo. Ta daoline nie <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de kielie kurughadene dou alasan ene kunni chusunni zhanni bijienyi jiere beilieghane." <verse eid="ACT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char>, pse shitula kieliewo, "Hudai shunjizhi kunyi ulie shunjise indanji wo. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Mai xienrenni Huda ta mutun jiere guaidene alasan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i aminne olughawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Huda hhei undudaghazhi borun miendene khighawo. Hhei honshan, jiuichen danlaghazhi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunni geizhen gieghazhi zuini mienliene giezho. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Bijien ene shiqinlade ganzhen beine. Hudai shunjisan kunlade ogisan Shenlinye ganzhen beine."<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Zui fugie fayenni kunla enei chenliedene hende hokuzhi hhelai alane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Nie Falisai kunyi niereini <char style="pn">Jiamalie</char> giene. Hheshi nie jinwun loushi wo, kunla man hhei zunjine. Zui fugie fayende bosi ire kunlade fenfulazhi shitulai ghadane niecha khireigha giewo. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Ingie kunlade kieliewo, "<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla, ta ene kunlai xioxin giezhi chuli gie. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Eqighandei <char style="pn">Duda</char> bosi ire goyane fugie wo giezho. Hhei daghasan kun 400 wine. Hhei alasenu daghasan kunlai man sanda widazhi yama widawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Hhense khuinashi hukou denji giekude <char style="png">Jialili</char>ni <char style="pn">Yuda</char> bexinlai yela giezhi goyane daghaghawoma, hhe fuguse daghasan kunla man sanda widawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Ede bi tande kielieye, ta ene kunlase gholodo. Hhelai bu gonji. Hhelai jihua, giesanlashi kunse irese widane. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Hudase iresan enbese ta hhelai widagha dane. Ta kenen Hudare duitou gholune."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Zui fugie fayenni kunla hhei kieliei shunjidene <verse eid="ACT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>shitulai uru ire idun eghidene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala bu kielie gie andaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Shitula <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i nierede oluzhi jiuren giese pei shidane giezhi hende bayasudene zui fugie fayense likai giewo.<verse eid="ACT 5:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Hhela niudunie mechide, go gielade ese beidene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi Mexiha wo giezhi kunlade sughazhi gouxioxini chonjizho.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Dolon Kunni Sunghuzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Hhe oloncha tuji niudunie olodozho. Niudunieku shenhofei ogiku shiqin jiere <char style="png">Xila</char> kielien kieliechen <char style="png">Yutai</char>i guafulai jiezho. Ingiese hhela <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kielien kieliechen <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade boxin kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Ingie 12 gie shitu olon tujilai uru ire kieliewo, "Matan Hudai kielienyi chonjikui bendazhi jiedene ijiekui gonjise heshi uwo. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Gaijiula, tai dundase gou minshentu, Shenlin duruzhi agheli olontu dolon ere kunyi sunghuzhi ene shiqinlai gonjighaye. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Ingiese matan zhomen onxian giezhi pse Hudai kieliende giene."<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Kunla man ene kielienyi zanchen giedene <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>, <char style="pn">Feili</char>, <char style="pn">Bologelo</char>, <char style="pn">Nijiano</char>, <char style="pn">Qimun</char>, <char style="pn">Bamina</char>, pse Yutaijiode suisan <char style="png">Anqiya</char> kun <char style="pn">Nigela</char>i sunghuwo. <char style="pn">Siqifan</char> xianxin giesan gou wo, Shenlinye duruzho. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Enelai shitulai melie beighase shitula onxian giezhi hhelai jiere khane teiwo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Hudai kielien ondazhi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de tujila zhenzhen olodozho. Tebie olon buwalaye ene xinyanni shunjizho.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siqifanni Bareizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>
    <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>de Hudai nenjien, nenli olonshi kunlai dunda fugie shiqin, ghudureqi giezho. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Ingiese Ziyutu kunla giezhi urusan huitanni giedun kun bosi ire <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>ghala jianjinduwo. Enelashi <char style="png">Gulinai</char>, <char style="png">Yalishanda</char>, <char style="png">Jilijia</char>, <char style="png">Yaxiya</char> gochuse irezho. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/><char style="pn">Siqifan</char> agheli, Shenlinyi kouizhi kielien kieliese hhela dui dane. <verse eid="ACT 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Ingie kunlai baerghala agidene kielieghawo, "Bijien chenliese <char style="pn">Siqifan</char> <char style="pn">Musa</char>, Hudaghalai sugiezho." <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Hhela bexin, zhanlao, jinwun hanjialai shanjizhi <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>yi hhende echighase barei zui fugie fayende irewo. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Hhela pse jia ganzhen beisan kunlai uru ire kielieghawo, "Ene kun zhiguitu oronji <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni guijinni sugiezhi ese beizho. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>Bijien chenliese hhe kieliezhi <char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char> mechii furaghane, pse <char style="pn">Musa</char> matande ogisan guijinni geighane giezho." <verse eid="ACT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Zui fugie fayende sousan kunla man <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>ni xianxide uzhese ungieni qienxienni ungiei xianli.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Siqifan Jianjisan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Zui fugie buwa <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>de asawo, "Intu shiqin winu?"<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>
    <char style="pn">Siqifan</char> kieliewo, "Oqio kun, gaijiula, ta chenliendu. Matai xienren <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> <char style="png">Halan</char>de soutula <char style="png">Meisobudamiya</char>de bikude famatu Huda hhende xienjighadene kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>'Chi goya oron, jiawusene likai giezhi bi chade uzheghaku oronde echi.'"<verse eid="ACT 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>"Ingie hhe <char style="png">Jialeji</char> kunlai oronse likai giedene <char style="png">Halan</char>de souwo. Hhei adani fugudene Huda hhei banjighazhi ta ede sousan ene oronde ireghawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>Ene oronde Huda hhende yama jiachan, lien beiku oronye uye ogiwoma, Huda kielien yenjizhi ene oronyi hhende, hhei houdeide ogizhi caichan gie giewo. Hhe shihoude hhende kewosi uwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Ingiese Huda kieliewo, 'Houdeichii kunlai oronde souzhi hoji danlazhi 400 nien zayalane.' <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Pse kieliewo, 'Hhelai hoji danlaghasan gojiani bi panjine. Khuinashi hhela khizhedene ene oronde mii shunjine.' <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Ingiedene Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de hetoune giekughala kielien yenjiwo. <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>ni oluzhi neimudude hetoune giewo. <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>de <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>ni oluwo, <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>de mai 12 gie famatu xienrenlai oluwo."<verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>"Ene famatu xienrenla <char style="pn">Yusufu</char> jiuni dubiliedene <char style="png">Aiji</char>de huiwo. Ingieliuzhe Huda hheghala hhantushi <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>hhei yan kunnanseliuzhe khizheghawo. Huda hhende nenjien, agheli ogise <char style="png">Aiji</char>ni <char style="pn">Falao</char> honshan hhei uzhedan gou wo. <char style="pn">Falao</char> hhei <char style="png">Aiji</char>de zui fugie noyen danlaghazhi giene man gonjighawo."<verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>"Ingiedene <char style="png">Aiji</char>, <char style="png">Jianan</char>de honnien kuzhezhi zeinan irewo. Mai xienrenlade taran sirawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/><char style="pn">Yagebu</char> sonosuse <char style="png">Aiji</char>de taran wine. Ingie mai xienrenlani peizhi tou 1 hui hhende echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>2 huide echise <char style="pn">Yusufu</char> gaijiuladene tanighawo. Ingiese <char style="pn">Falao</char> hhei gieni qinkonyi mejiewo. <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/><char style="pn">Yusufu</char> kun peizhi adane nie gie kunyi jienlieghale echiwo. Man 75 gie kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Yagebu</char> <char style="png">Aiji</char>de bouzhewo. Khuinashi <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>, mai xienrenla man hhende duya ijiewo. <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Hhelai laizhi <char style="png">Shijien</char>de echi <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> <char style="pn">Hamo</char>ni houdeilase miengughala agisan mezade bulawo."<verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>"Huda <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>de yenjisan kielien kuzhekude <char style="png">Aiji</char>de <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla hende olodowo. <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Khuinashi <char style="pn">Yusufu</char>i tani dachen nie shini honshan khizhezhi <char style="png">Aiji</char>ni gonjizho. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Hhe mai kunlai heizhi xienrenlai mai zayalazho. Hhelai biizhi yeliwalai bendaghazhi aminne ese olughazho."<verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>"Hhe shihoude <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni oluwo. Hudai melie hhe uzhezhi seighan wo. Hhei adaini giede ghuran sara qiezhedene <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>bendase <char style="pn">Falao</char>i oqin kewonni giedene qiezhe fugiedaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> <char style="png">Aiji</char> kunlai unhuani man suruwo. Kielien kielie, shiqin giese nenli wine."<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>"<char style="pn">Musa</char> 40 olukude goya <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlane uzhele echine giezhi jiejin giewo. <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Niefade hhe echikude nie <char style="png">Aiji</char> kun nie <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunyi qifulasanyi chanlasenu hhe <char style="png">Aiji</char> kunyi alazhi hhe kunde bouchou giewo. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Hhe sumulase Huda hhei tungo giezhi goya kunlai jiuikui mejiemu giezhoma, hhela mejie dazho. <verse eid="ACT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>Khuichudu <char style="pn">Musa</char> chanlase <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla eghinduzho. Hhelai sidaghazhi kieliewo, 'Gujiu, tashi gaijiula wo, yale nieniene qifulane?'"<verse eid="ACT 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>"Giebeine qifulasan kun <char style="pn">Musa</char>i tungu daogha kieliewo, 'Kien chii bijiende lindao, panjichen kun danlaghawo? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Chi uchughudu hhe <char style="png">Aiji</char> kunyi alaku mutun mii alanu?' <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> ene kielienyi chenliedene <char style="png">Aiji</char>se ghula holu <char style="png">Mijien</char>de toreisan mutun souwo. Hhe oronde hhende ghua kewon oluwo."<verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>"40 nien daose <char style="png">Xinaishan</char> hontande nie qienxien siderasan eghesun dunda <char style="pn">Musa</char>de chanlaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> zhoujin mutunyi chanladene ghanirazhi melie daozhi uzhene giekude Ezhanyi shenqii sonosuwo, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>'Bishi chii xienrenlai Huda wo. <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>, <char style="pn">Isaghei</char>, <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>ni Huda wo.' <char style="pn">Musa</char> chenliesenu pugharadene ayizhi uzhe dazho. <verse eid="ACT 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>Ezhan hhende kieliewo, 'Chi kon jieredu maheine tei. Chi beisan oronshi zhiguitu oron wo. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Mii bexinlai <char style="png">Aiji</char>de zayalasanyi bi qinchude chanlawo. Hhela shonholosan shenqiiye sonosuwo. Bi hhelai jiuile bouzhewo. Ede ire, bi chii peizhi <char style="png">Aiji</char>de echighane.'"<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>"Eneshi bexinla kien chii bijiende lindao, panjichen kun danlaghawo giezhi fandui giesan <char style="pn">Musa</char> wo. Ingieliuzhe Huda siderasan eghesun dunda qienxienyi tungo giezhi hhei peidene bexinlade noyen, jiuichen danlaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/><char style="pn">Musa</char> <char style="png">Aiji</char>, <char style="png">Hunhai</char>, hontande 40 nien olon fugie shiqin, ghudureqi giezhi bexinlai <char style="png">Aiji</char>se uduru khizhewo."<verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>"Eneshijiu <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlade 'Huda tai dundase bi mutun nie xienzhi khizheghane.' giezhi kieliesan hhe <char style="pn">Musa</char> wo. <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Ene <char style="pn">Musa</char> hontandedu <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlare hhantu wo. Mai xienrenghala hhantu <char style="png">Xinaishan</char> jiere hhende kielien kieliesan qienxienyi tungo giezhi amin ogiku kielienyi jienliedene matande chonjizhi ogiwo."<verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>"Mai xienrenla hhei kielienyi ese chenliedene hhei tungu daoghazhi <char style="png">Aiji</char>de khareiku duralazho. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Hhela <char style="pn">Hharune</char>de kieliewo, 'Bijiende mo uduruku nigiedalani gie. Bijienyi <char style="png">Aiji</char>se uduru khizhesan <char style="pn">Musa</char> yan shiqin penji woshi bijien ulie mejiene.' <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Ingie hhe shihoude hhela nie fughe giedene hhe nigiedade mure khughozhi goya khaghalane giesanlade beiizhi bayasunduzho. <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Ingiese Huda hhelase likai giedene hhela asiman jieredu naran, sara, hodunlai beiise uye gonjizho. Zhen xienzhii shu jiere huaisan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">'<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">ta hontande 40 nien dunda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">zharusan ghoni fugheji pse ogisan mureshi made giesan pusho.<verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Ta qienliesanshi <char style="pn">Molo</char> nigiedani zhanfan wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="pn">Lifan</char> nigiedani hodun wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Enelashi ta goyala beiine giezhi giesan nigiedala wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">Ingiese bi tai touzhi <char style="png">Babilun</char> ghadane khighane.'"<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>"Mai xienrenla hontande bikude ganzhen beiku zhanfan wine. Hheshi Huda <char style="pn">Musa</char>de fenfuladene uzheghasan yanzi mutun gieghasan wo. <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Mai xienrenla ene zhanfanyi jienliewo. Huda hhelai melie niman kunlai tou khighasan oronde hhela <char style="pn">Yeshuya</char>re hhantu zhanfanyi agi echizhi <char style="pn">Dawude</char> honshanni shihou kuruwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Huda <char style="pn">Dawude</char>de orezho. Ingiese hhe Hudai xiahua giezhi <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>i houdeilade Huda souku oron zhunbei giene giezhoma, <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Hudade giei beighasanshi <char style="pn">Sulumane</char> wo."<verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>"Ingiezhoma, Zui Unduni Huda kun khaghalane giesan giede ulie soune. Xienzhi kieliesan kielien mutun wo,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>Ezhan kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">'Asimanshi mii zowi wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Zeminshi mii bandou wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Ta made matui gie giene?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Khalashi bi hhamuraku oron wo?<verse eid="ACT 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Enelashi man bi khaghalane giesan pushonu?'"<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>"Ta ene jianbanjin kunla, zhughe, chighindene hetoune ese giesan kunla. Ta xienrenlane mutun ibeizi Shenlinni fandui giezho. <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Alinie xienzhilai tai xienrenla ese heiwo? Hhela nie gou kun irene giezhi melie kieliesan xienzhilai alawo. Ede ta hhe gou kunni ghudanduzhi alawo. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Ta qienxienla chonjizhi ogisan guijinni jienliedene ese zunjiwo."<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s">Siqifanni Alazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Hhela ene kielienyi chenliedene <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>de hende hokuzhi shidunne zhouzho. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/><char style="pn">Siqifan</char>de Shenlin duruzhi asimanyi xianxide uzhezhi Hudai fama, pse <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Hudai borun miende beisei chanladene kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>"Asiman keizhi Kunnikewon Hudai borun miende beisei bi chanlawo."<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Ingiese kunla chighinne duigha fugiede onghonozhi hhei melie chunji echidene <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>hhei chenshi ghadane tungu khigha tashighala eghi qiiwo. Ganzhen beisan kunla jienne teidene nie <char style="pn">Saolo</char> giezhi urusan nasuchighan kunyi kon konde jiewo. <verse eid="ACT 7:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Hhela tashighala eghikude <char style="pn">Siqifan</char> onxian giezhi kieliewo, "Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>, mii ruhherni jienlie!" <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Pse xiutuliezhi fugiede kieliewo, "Ezhan, ene zuini hhelade bu sougha!" Ene kielienyi kieliedene fuguwo.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>yi alasande <char style="pn">Saolo</char> tunyi giewo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Saolo Jiohuini Heizho</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Ene uduse <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni jiohuii hende heizho. Shitulase chugo psedu tujila sandazhi <char style="png">Yudaya</char>, <char style="png">Samaliya</char>ni go oronde echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Niezhan xienliantu kunla <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>yi buladene hhende oluzhi fugiede wilazho. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/><char style="pn">Saolo</char> jiohuini heizhi jien kunlai giede orodene ere kun, biereilai bafanzide lai echi khawo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feili Samaliyade Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Hhe sandasan kunla gochude echizhi Hudai kielienyi chonjizho. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/><char style="pn">Feili</char> <char style="png">Samaliya</char>i chenshide echizhi kunlade Mexihai chonjizho. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Olon kunla <char style="pn">Feili</char> kieliesan kielienyi chenliezhi giesan ghudureqii uzhedene man hhei kielienyi goude chenliezho. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Olon kunlai jierese zannan ruhherla fugiede nie onghonodene likai giewo. Pse olon tanhon giesan, dogholonlai goudaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Ingiese hhe chenshii kunla hende bayasuzho.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Hhe chenshide nie kunyi nierei <char style="pn">Ximun</char> giene. Eqighanse baxi shuaizhi bi hen wo giezho. <char style="png">Samaliya</char>i bexinlai ghaniraghazho. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Bugon fugiei ganii man hhei daghazhi ene kunshi fugie nenlitu giezhi urusan Hudai nenli wo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Hhela hhei chenliekushi hhe oloncha baxi shuaizhi hhelai ghaniraghazho. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Ingiekude <char style="pn">Feili</char> hhelade Hudai gojiai gouxioxi, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai nierei chonjise hhela xianxin giezhi ere kun, biereila xili jienliewo. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Lien <char style="pn">Ximun</char>ye xianxin giedene xili jienliewo. Hhe <char style="pn">Feili</char>ghala chan hhantulazhi <char style="pn">Feili</char> giesan ghudureqi, fugie nenlitu shiqinlai uzhedene ghanirazho.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Shitula <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de bikude chenliese <char style="png">Samaliya</char> kunla Hudai kielienyi jienliewo giese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghalai hhelai hhende echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Hheghala boudene hhelade Shenlinyi jienlieghane giezhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Shenlin kiemai jiere ese bouzhezho. Hhela zinie Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala xili jienliezho. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala hhelai jiere khane teise hhela Shenlinyi jienliewo.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Shitula khane teise Shenlin bouzhesei <char style="pn">Ximun</char> chanladene baerne hhelade ogizhi <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>kieliewo, "Ene nenlii madeye ogi. Bi kienyi jiere khane teizhi onxian giese kienye Shenlinyi jienliene."<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "Chi baerghalane hhantu fugule echi. Chi sumulase Huda ogiku nenjienni baerghala aginu? <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Ene wiliede chade guzi uwo. Hudai melie chii zhughe donzhen uwo. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Chi ene doghunnii geizhi Ezhanni xiahua gie. Kenen chi zhughedene sumulasei mienliene. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Bi uzhese chii zhughede dubilieku olon wo, gou wini chii banlazho."<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Ximun</char> kieliewo, "Ta made oluzhi Ezhanni xiahua gie. Ingiese ta kieliesanla mii jiere nieda ulie irene."<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ghala Ezhanyi kielienni kieliezhi ganzhen beidene <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khareiwo. Idou mo jiere <char style="png">Samaliya</char>ni go aghinlade gouxioxii chonjizho.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feili Taijienghala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Ingiekude Ezhanni qienxien <char style="pn">Feili</char>de kieliewo, "Chi bosidene nanbangiede yo. <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se <char style="png">Jiasa</char>de bouku mo jiere echi." Hhe mo hontande wo. <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/><char style="pn">Feili</char> bosizhedene echise mo jiere nie <char style="png">Aisaiebiya</char> kunyi chanlawo. Ene kunshi <char style="png">Aisaiebiya</char> bierei honshan <char style="pn">Gandaji</char>ni kha douradu taijien wo. Hheshi bierei honshanni baerlai man gonjisan fugie noyen wo. <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de libai giezhi irezho. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Khareiku mo jiere mache souzhi xienzhi <char style="pn">Isaiya</char>i shuni onshizho. <verse eid="ACT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Shenlin <char style="pn">Feili</char>de kieliewo, "Chi gierudene chezii shigha."<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>
    <char style="pn">Feili</char> holuzhi echise xienzhi <char style="pn">Isaiya</char>i shuni onshisei sonosuwo. Ingie hhende asawo, "Chi onshisanne dunjirenu?"<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Hhe kieliewo, "Mii kiema ese uduruzho, bi matugie dunjirene?" Ingie <char style="pn">Feili</char>i chezi jierene uru khirei hhantu souwo.<verse eid="ACT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Hhe onshisan jinwun jiere kieliezho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">"Hhei ghoni zharuchen kun shida echiku ghoni mutun lai echiwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Usun ghighachen kunni kha douradu qioqioji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ghoni mutun hhe amanne ese angheiwo.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>Kunla hhei uru giezho, gundande ese panjiwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Hhei aminni duyase agi echiwo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">Kunlade kielieku houdeiye uwo."<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Taijien <char style="pn">Feili</char>de kieliewo, "Bi nie asaye, xienzhi kieliesan ene kielienshi kienyi kieliezho? Goyane kieliezhou? Pse nie kunyi kieliezho?" <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/><char style="pn">Feili</char> ene jinwunse kaishi giezhi hhende <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i gouxioxii jianji qiiwo.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Hhela mo jiere yokude usu winetu oronde kuruwo. Taijien kieliewo, "Uzhe, enende usu wine. Bi enende xili jienliese ulie olunu?" <verse eid="ACT 8:36"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Ingie fenfulazhi chezii beighadene <char style="pn">Feili</char> taijienghala usude bouzhi <char style="pn">Feili</char> hhende xili gieghawo. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Ususe khizhese Ezhanyi Shenlin <char style="pn">Feili</char>i uduru yolawo. Taijien hhei chanla dawo. Ingiedene bayasuzhi mone yowo. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Feili</char>i <char style="png">Yasodu</char>de chanlawo. Hhe yozhi go chenshilade gouxioxii chonjizhi izhi <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de kuruwo.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Saolo Ezhanni Xianxin Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Saolo</char> izhigie Ezhanyi tujilai alane giezhi ayighazho. Ingie zui fugie buwai hhende echidene <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/><char style="png">Damashige</char>ni go huitande echiku xinni kerewo. Ene daolini daghasan kunyi faxien giese bugon bierei ere kun barei <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de lai echine giezho.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>
    <char style="pn">Saolo</char> mo jiere yozhi <char style="png">Damashige</char>de kurukude menzhali asiman jierese gonqi faizhi hhei simiende zhouizho. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>Ingie hhe zemin jiere fura bouwo. Sonususe nie shenqi hhende kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Saolo</char>! <char style="pn">Saolo</char>! Chi mii yale heine?" <verse eid="ACT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Hhe kieliewo, "Ezhan, chishi kien wo?" "Bishi chi heisan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo. <verse eid="ACT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Chi bosizhedene chenshide echi. Hhende matui giekui chade kieliene." <verse eid="ACT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Hhantu yosan kunla shenqii sonosuzhoma kunni chanla dase beidene kielien kielie dazho. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/><char style="pn">Saolo</char> zemin jierese bosise nudunne niewoma, yama chanla dane. Kunla hhei khase lai <char style="png">Damashige</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Ghurudu chanla dadene yama ese ijiezhi ese ochiwo.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>
    <char style="png">Damashige</char>de nie tuji wine. Niereini <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> giene. Ezhan zhoujin mutun xienjighazhi hhende kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Yananiya</char>." Hhe kieliewo, "Ezhan, matugiewo?" <verse eid="ACT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Ezhan hhende kieliewo, "Chi bosizhedene <char style="png">Dondonji</char> giezhi urusan geidoude echizhi <char style="pn">Yuda</char>i giede nie <char style="png">Dashu</char> kunyi erei. Niereini <char style="pn">Saolo</char> giene. Hhe zhen onxian giezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Hhe zhoujin mutun chanlase <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> giesan nie kun oro iredene hhei jiere khane teise goudawo." <verse eid="ACT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> kieliewo, "Ezhan, bi sonosuse ene kun <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de chii shentulade olon doghun shiqin giezho giezhi olon kunla kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Hhe pse fugie buwalase chii beiisan jien kunlai bareiku qienlii kere enende irezho."<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Ingiese Ezhan hhende kieliewo, "Chi echi. Hheshi niman kun, honshan, <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlade bi nierene chonjighane giezhi sunghusan rencai wo. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Hhe mii nierede bixi olon ku shoukui bi hhende mejieghane."<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> echidene hhei giede orowo. Khane <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i jiere teizhi kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Saolo</char> gaijiu, chi ireku mo jiere chade chujiegheghasan Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> mii ireghakushi chii pse chanlaghazhi chade Shenlin durughane giezho." <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i nudun jierese deigo zhaghasun arasun mutun nie dunxi bou irese hhe chanlawo. Ingiedene bosi ire xili jienliewo. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Ijiewuni ijiedene lilian orowo.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Saolo Damashigede Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">
    <char style="pn">Saolo</char> <char style="png">Damashige</char>ni tujilare hhantu giedudu souzhi <verse eid="ACT 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>deigo <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi Hudai kewon wo giezhi go huitanlade chonjizho. <verse eid="ACT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Jien ene kielienyi chenliesan kunla man ghaniradene kieliewo, "Ene kunshi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i beiisan kunlai heisan hhe kun pushonu? Hhe enende irezhi hhelai bareidene fugie buwalade ogine ese giezhou?" <verse eid="ACT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/><char style="pn">Saolo</char>de yebeiseye nenli olodozhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi Mexiha bikui zhenmin giese <char style="png">Damashige</char>ni <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai kielie beighawo.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saolo Yutai Kunlai Khase Andawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Ezighancha daose <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i alane giezhi shanlian giezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Hhela alane gieku jihuai kunla <char style="pn">Saolo</char>de mejieghawo. Hhela xieni udu chenshi wijiende sagheizhi hhei alane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Nie xiidei hhei tujila nie lanlande hhei orogha chenqian jierese jiuzhilie bouzheghawo.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Saolo Yelusalende Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>
    <char style="pn">Saolo</char> <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de kuzhedene psedu tujilare hhantulane giezhoma, hhe tuji gholusei xianxin gie dase hhela man ayizho. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Banaba</char> hhei jienliedene uduruzhi shitulai shida echiwo. Hhe mo jiere matugiezhi Ezhanyi chanlasei, Ezhan hhende kielien kieliesei, hhe <char style="png">Damashige</char>de danzine fugiedaghazhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala jianjisei man kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Ingiedene <char style="pn">Saolo</char> <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de tujilare hhantulazhi ziyude yozho. Ezhanyi niereghala danzine fugiedagha kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Hhe pse <char style="png">Xila</char> kielien kieliechen <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlare kieliezhi jianjinduzho. Ingiese hhela <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i alane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Gaijiula enei mejiedene hhei <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de khughozhi boughadene <char style="png">Dashu</char>de echighawo.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Ingiekude <char style="png">Yudaya</char>, <char style="png">Jialili</char>, <char style="png">Samaliya</char>i gochudedu jiohui man pinnanshizhi hendawo. Hhela Ezhanyi zunjizhi giezho. Shenlin hhelai bayasughazho. Ingiese xianxin giesan kunla yebeiseye olodozho.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iniyani Goudaghazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> gochude yokude <char style="png">Lida</char> oronde sousan shentulai hhende echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Hhende <char style="pn">Iniya</char> giesan nie kunni chanlawo. Tanhon giezhi ruzi jiere 8 nien kijiezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> hhende kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Iniya</char>, <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexiha chii goudaghawo. Bosizhedene ruzine shidolo agi!" Ingiese hhe deigo bosi irewo. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Jien <char style="png">Lida</char>, <char style="png">Shalun</char>de sousan kunla hhei chanladene man Ezhanyi shunjiwo.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dojia Aminne Oluzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>
    <char style="png">Yepa</char>de nie oqitu tuji wo. Niereini <char style="pn">Dabida</char> giene, <char style="png">Xila</char> kielienghala kieliese <char style="pn">Dojia</char> giene, isishi lugo wo. Hhe chanqi gounii giezhi nanxin kunlade banman giezho. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Hhe shihoude hhe giemere fuguse kunla beyeini waghadene lou jiere teiwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/><char style="png">Lida</char> <char style="png">Yepa</char>ghala chada wo. <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="png">Lida</char>de bikui tujila sonosusenu ghua kunyi peizhi echighadene xiahua giezhi danwu bu giezhi bijienyi hhende ghujighan yo giezho.<verse eid="ACT 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> qiizhi hhelare hhantu kuruse kunla uduru lou jiere khireiwo. Olon guafu biereila <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i kanzide beidene wilazhi <char style="pn">Dojia</char> hhelare hhantu bikude giesan lizii jien, mienzii jienlai uzheghawo. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> kunlai man kieliezhi ghadane khighadene xiutuliezhi onxian giewo. Ingie fugusan kunyi miende ochiradene kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Dabida</char>, bosizhe!" Ingiese hhe nudunne nie <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i chanla bosi ire souwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> khaghalane hhei fui bosighawo. Ingie shentulai, guafulai uru orozhe, <char style="pn">Dojia</char>i amitu hhelade jiuizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Ene shiqin <char style="png">Yepa</char>de man chonji kurudene olon kunla Ezhanyi xianxin giewo. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Khuinashi <char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="png">Yepa</char>ni nie arasun giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char>yi giede ezighancha souwo.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Geniliu Bedurui Uruzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>
    <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de nie kunyi niereini <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> giene. Hheshi <char style="png">Idali</char> buduitonni baifuzhan wo. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Hheshi nie xienliantu kun wo. Nie gie kunlai man Hudai zunjizho. Da nanxin kunlade olon banman giezhi Hudase chan onxian giezho. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Niudude xiawu 3 jien olukude hhe zhoujin mutun qinchude chanlase Hudai nie qienxien oro ire <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> giezhi uruwo.<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>
    <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> xianxide nie uzhe ayizhi kieliewo, "Ezhan, yan shiqin wo?" Qienxien kieliewo, "Chi onxian giesan, nanxin kunlade banman giesanla Hudai melie echizhi jilawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Ede chi kun peizhi <char style="png">Yepa</char>se <char style="pn">Beduru</char> giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char>ni xinlazhi ire. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Hhe nie arasun jiagun giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char>yi giede souzho. Gieni haibienzide wo."<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Hhende kielien kieliesan qienxien yoladene <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> giene ghua hojini, pse hhei chan ushilasan nie xienliantu buduini uru ire <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>ene shiqinyi man kieliezhi ogidene peizhi <char style="png">Yepa</char>de echighawo.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Khuichudu hhela yozhi hhe chenshide kurukude <char style="pn">Beduru</char> zhunwude gie jiere onxian giele khireiwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>Hhe oliesuzhi ijiene giezho. Kunla ijiuni zhunbei giekude <char style="pn">Beduru</char> zhoujin mutun nie ghudureqi chanlase <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>asiman keizhi hoxian nie fugie popu mutun dunxi bouzhewo. Jieran gozii banladene zemin jiere bou irewo. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Hhe sudoro zemin jieredu yanyanji jieran zhuazhuatu chushen, ghughei, pse asiman jiere musisanla wine. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Nie shenyin irezhi hhende kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Beduru</char>, bosizhedene ala ijie."<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, "Ezhan, ulie olune. Ganjin wini, zannannilai bi ijiezhi ese daozho."<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>2 hui shenyin pse hhende kieliewo, "Huda ganjin wo giesanni chi ganjin uwo giezhi bu kielie."<verse eid="ACT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Ingiezhi ghureifashi hhe dunxilai deigo asiman jiere agi khireiwo.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> zhoujin mutun chanlasanshi yan isi wo giezhi zhughedene zhen sumulakude <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> peisan kunla asazhi <char style="pn">Ximun</char>yi gieni wijien konde beizho. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Hhela waradazhi, "<char style="pn">Beduru</char> giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char> enende souzhoye?" giezhi asazho.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> dou zhoujin mutun chanlasei sumulakude Shenlin hhende kieliewo, "Ghuran kun chii ereizho. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Bosi, boudene yama bu sumulazhi hhelare hhantu echi. Hhelashi bi ireghasan wo."<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> boudene hhelade kieliewo, "Bishi ta ereisan kun wo. Ta yangiezhi irezho?"<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Hhela kieliewo, "Baifuzhan <char style="pn">Geniliu</char>shi Hudai zunjisan nie gou kun wo. <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla man hhei zunzhun giene. Nie zhiguitu qienxien hhende kieliezhi chii xinlazhi giedene iredene chi jianjisei chenlie giezho." <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> hhelai uruzhi oro nie xii soughawo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Khuichudu zhunbei gie hhelare hhantu echiwo. <char style="png">Yepa</char>ni giedun gaijiulaye hhantu echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Pse niudude hhela <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de kuruwo. <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> qingu, gou zhanlienlane uruzhi ire hhelai sagheizho. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> orone giekude <char style="pn">Geniliu</char> hhei jienliedene kon kondeni papalazhi beiiwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> hhei fei bosigha kieliewo, "Bosizhe. Bishiye nie kun wo." <verse eid="ACT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> hheghala kielienduzhi orose olon kunla hhantulasei chanlawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>Ingie hhelade kieliewo, "Bijien <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun niman kunghala laiwon giezhi hhantulase ese olusei ta goyane mejienema, yan kunyiliuzhe ganjin uwo, zannan wo giezhi kieliese ese olusei Huda made uzheghawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Ingiese ta mii xinlakude bi tuichi ese giezhi irewo. Ede bi tande asaye, ta mii yan shiqinde xinlazho?" <verse eid="ACT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/><char style="pn">Geniliu</char> kieliewo, "Jierudu melie ene shihoude bi giedene onxian giezho. Xiawu 3 jiende wo. Menzhali nie rouiku jien musisan kun mii melie beidene <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>kieliezho, '<char style="pn">Geniliu</char>, chi onxian giesan, nanxin kunlade banman giesanlai Huda chenliezhi jilawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Ingiese chi kun peizhi <char style="png">Yepa</char>se <char style="pn">Beduru</char> giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char>yi xinlazhi ire. Hhe haibienzini nie arasun jiagun giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char>yi giede souzho.' <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Ingiese bi deigo kun peizhi chii xinlaghale echiwo. Chi irese gou wo. Ede bijien Ezhan chade fenfulasan kielienlai man chenliene giezhi Hudai melie hhantulazho."<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beduru Geniliui Giede Jianjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kielie qiiwo, "Huda kunlade pienxin ulie giekui bi shuhua mejiewo. <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Alinie gojiai kunlaliuzhe Hudai zunjizhi olusei giese Huda jienliene. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Taye mejieku mutun Huda yanyanjini Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani tungo giezhi pinnantu gouxioxi daolini <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlade chonjizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/><char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> xili giekui jianjizhi daodene ene daolii <char style="png">Jialili</char>se kaishi giezhi <char style="png">Yudaya</char> go oronlade chonji kuruwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/><char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de Huda Shenlin, nenlini olon ogiwo. Huda hheghala hhantushi hhe gochude yozhi gouni giezho. Ibilisi heisanlai man uzhezhi goudaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>Bijien hhe kun <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni oronde, <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de giesan shiqinlade ganzhen beine. Kunla hhei mutun jiere guaidene alawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Ghurudude Huda hhei aminne olughazhi kunlade chanlaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Soyuji kunlade ese chanlaghazhi zinie Huda sunghuzhi hhende ganzhen beighane giesan bijiende chanlaghawo. Bijienshi hhe fugusan kun dundase aminne oludene hhere hhantu ijiezhi ochisan kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Hhe bijiende fenfulazhi kunlade ene daolii chonji giewo. "Hheshijiu Huda sunghuzhi amitu kun, fugusan kunyi panjichen wo." giezhi ganzhen bei giezho. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Xienzhila man hhende ganzhen beizhi kieliewo, 'Hhei xianxin giesan kunla hhei niereghala zuini mienliene.'"<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Niman Kunla Shenlinyi Jienliewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kielien kieliekude daoli chenliesan jien kunlai jiere Shenlin bouzhewo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char>ghala hhantu iresan <char style="png">Yutai</char>ni Mexihai xianxin giesan kunla Shenlinni nenjien niman kunlai jiere kie bouzhese ghanirakushi <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>hhela pseshiku kielienyi kieliezhi Hudashi fugie wo giezhi doulasei sonosuzho. Ingiese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>"Enezighan kunla bijien mutun Shenlinyi jienliewo. Ede usughala hhelade xili gieghase kien danla shidane?" <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Ingie fenfulazhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai niereghala hhelade xili gieghawo. Hhela pse <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i danlazhi giedudu soughawo.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Beduru Yelusalenni Jiohuide Boulazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Niman kunla Hudai kielienyi jienliesei shitula, <char style="png">Yudaya</char>ni gaijiula sonosuwo. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de echise <char style="png">Yutai</char>ni Mexihai xianxin giesan kunla hhei sugiezhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>"Chi hetoune ese giesan kunlai giede echizhi dou hhelare hhantu ijiene?" <verse eid="ACT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Beduru</char> ene shiqinni hhelade qiqiji kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>"Bi <char style="png">Yepa</char> chenshide onxian giekude zhoujin mutun nie ghudureqi chanlase hoxian nie fugie popu mutun dunxi bouzhezhi jieran gozii banlazho. Asiman jierese bouzhe mii melie irewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Bi xianxide uzhese sudoro zemin jieredu jieran zhuazhuatu chushen, yewo, ghughei, pse asiman jiere musisanla wine. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>Bi sonosuse nie shenyin made kieliewo, '<char style="pn">Beduru</char>, bosizhedene ala ijie.' <verse eid="ACT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>Ingie bi kieliewo, 'Ezhan, ulie olune. Ganjin wini, zannannila mii amande orozhi ese daozho.' <verse eid="ACT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>2 hui shenyin asiman jierese kieliewo, 'Huda ganjin wo giesanni chi ganjin uwo giezhi bu kielie.' <verse eid="ACT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>Ingiezhi ghureifashi man asiman jiere agi khireiwo. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Zhen qingiekude <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>se mii xinlaghale iresan ghuran kun bijien sousan gie konde beizho. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>Shenlin made fenfulazhi yama bu sumuladene hhelare hhantu echi giewo. Ingiese ene zhighon gaijiu mare hhantu echizhi bijien <char style="pn">Geniliu</char>i giede orowo. Hhe bijiende kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/><char style="pn">Geniliu</char> matugiezhi nie qienxienyi chanladene hhei giede beizhi chi kun peizhi <char style="png">Yepa</char>se <char style="pn">Beduru</char> giesan <char style="pn">Ximun</char>yi xinlazhi ire. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Hhe chii nie gie kunlai jiuiku daolii chade kieliene giesan kielienyi bijiende kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>Bi dei jianji qiise Shenlin hhelai jiere bouzhewo. Eqighandei matanyi jiere bouzhesan niekielien wo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> usughala xili gieghawoma, tai Shenlinghala xili gieghane giesan Ezhanyi kielienyi bi sumula irewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Huda hhelade ogisan nenjien matan Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai xianxin giekude matande ogisan nenjienghala niekielien wo. Bishi kien wo? Hudai duii shidanu?"<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Hhela ene kielienyi chenliedene yama ese kieliezhi qinse Huda niman kunladeye geizhen giezhi amin ireku jihui ogiwo giezhi Hudai kuaizho.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anqiyani Jiohui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Ene shihoude <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>ni shiqin jiere biisan kunla sandazhi <char style="png">Feiniji</char>, <char style="png">Saipulusi</char>, <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de echidene zinie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade Hudai kielienyi jianjizhoma, <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/><char style="png">Saipulusi</char>, <char style="png">Gulinai</char>se iresan niezhan kunla <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de kurudene <char style="png">Xila</char> kunladeye Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i gouxioxii jianjizho. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Ezhanni nenli hhelare hhantushi Ezhanyi xianxin giezhi shunjisan kun olonnudazho.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Ene xioxi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni jiohuii kunlai chighinde echiwo. Ingie hhela <char style="pn">Banaba</char>i peizhi <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Hhe kurudene Hudai nenjienyi chanla bayasuzhi kunlade khidunde beidene izhi Ezhanni koui giezhi sughazhi kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/><char style="pn">Banaba</char>shi nie gou kun wo. Hhende Shenlin duruzhi Hudade kouiku xianxin gieku fugie wo. Ingiese olon kunla Ezhande shunjiwo.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Hhe <char style="png">Dashu</char>se <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i ereile echi, <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>ereizhi oludene uduru <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de echiwo. Hhe ghuala duduji niehon hhe oronni jiohuini kunlaghala hhantulazhi olon kunlade surughazho. Tujilai <char style="png">Anqiya</char>se tou 1 hui Mexihani tuji giezhi uruzhi qiizho.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Hhe xienzide giedun xienzhila <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de bouzhi irewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Hhelai dundadu nie kunyi niereini <char style="pn">Yajiabu</char> giene. Bosi iredene duya jiere honnien kuzhene giezhi Shenlinyi tungo giezhi melie kieliewo. Ene shiqin <char style="pn">Kelaoji</char> gonjiku shihoude fashen giewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Ingiese tujila zhao goyane nenlighala <char style="png">Yudaya</char>de sousan gaijiulade baer khughozhi echighane giezhi jiejin giewo. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Hhela baerni ghuradene <char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Saolo</char> ghualai peizhi zhanlaolai hhende khughozhi echighawo.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Yagebuni Alazhi Beduruni Bareizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Hhe shihoude <char style="pn">Hherode</char> honshan jiohuini niezhan kunlai heiwo. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Khudoghoghala <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ni gaii <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>i alawo. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Hhe uzhese <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla ene shiqinde xiqishi <char style="pn">Beduru</char>iye bareighale echiwo. Hheshi zhen Tanmien Jieni udu wo. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char>i barei agi bafanzide khadene jieran duini buduilade uzheghazho. Nie duide jieran kun wo. Jiulidaosan Jie daose bexinlai melie hhei panjine giezho. <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char>i bafanzide khase jiohuini kunla hhende oluzhi Hudase hende onxian giezho.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Beduruni Jiui Khizhezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>
    <char style="pn">Hherode</char> <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i panjiku meliedu xii, <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i ghua qieshenghala sozilazhi ghua buduini dunda kijieghazho. Sagheisan kunla bafanzi wijien ghadane sagheizho. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Menzhali Ezhanyi qienxien xienjighazhi bafanzi sudoro gon zhouizho. Qienxien <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i lebadei peizhi xiereigha kieliewo, "Ghujighan bosizhe." Ingie qieshen hhei kha jierese anda bouwo.<verse eid="ACT 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Yodaine banlazhi maheine musi giezhi qienxien hhende kieliese hhe qingiezhi giewo. Qienxien pse kieliewo, "Jienne musidene mii dagha." <verse eid="ACT 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> khizhedene hhei daghawo. Qienxien giesanshi zhenni bikui mejie dazho, zhoujin wo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Bafanzii ji 1 gon ji 2 gonyi daodene chenshide khireiku qieman shida irese hhe wijien goyane niewo. Hhela khizhedene nie moni yozhi daose qienxien deigo hhense likai giewo.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> minbairedene kieliewo, "Ede bi zhenzhenji mejiewo. Ezhan qienxienne peizhi mii <char style="pn">Hherode</char>i khase, <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai xiwon giesanse jiuizhi khizhewo."<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> nie sumuladene <char style="pn">Mereiyen</char>i giede echiwo. Hheshi <char style="pn">Make</char> giesan <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>i anani wo. Hhende olon kunla hhantulazhi onxian giezho. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> wijienyi nie eghise <char style="pn">Loda</char> giesan nie hoji oqin wijien niele irewo. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Hhe <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i shenqii mejiedene bayasuzhi wijienyi ese nie, holuzhi echi kunlade kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Beduru</char> wijien ghadane beizho!"<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Hhela kieliewo, "Chi fenjiulizho!" Hoji oqin izhigie kieliezho, "Hhe enbene!" Hhela kieliezho, "Hheshi <char style="pn">Beduru</char>i qienxien wo."<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>
    <char style="pn">Beduru</char> ese beidene wijienyi eghizho. Hhela wijienyi niedene chanlase ghanirazho. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/><char style="pn">Beduru</char> khane zhadeighazhi hhelai shenqi bu khizhe giezho. Ingie hhelade Ezhan matugiezhi hhei bafanzise uduruzhi khizheghasei kieliewo. Pse ene shiqinni <char style="pn">Yagebu</char> psedu gaijiulade kielie giedene khizhe, psedu oronde echiwo.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Ogheidene buduila londundunde <char style="pn">Beduru</char> khala echisei mejie dazho. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/><char style="pn">Hherode</char> hhei ereizhi olu dase sagheisan kunlade asadene hhelai ala giezhi fenfulawo. Khuinashi <char style="pn">Hherode</char> <char style="png">Yudaya</char>se likai gie <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de bouzhi hhende souwo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hherodeni Ghughei Zhou Alazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>
    <char style="pn">Hherode</char> honshan <char style="png">Tuilo</char> kun, <char style="png">Xidun</char> kunlade hokuzho. Ene ghua oronni kunla honshanni oronse taran ijiezho. Ingie honshanni giei gonjisan <char style="pn">Bolasidu</char>i kielie shundaghadene hhantu <char style="pn">Hherode</char>i ochirale echi goudane giezhi xiahua giezho. <verse eid="ACT 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Jinjisan udude <char style="pn">Hherode</char> honshan jienne musi wizi jierene souzhi kunlade jianjizho. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Ingiese bexinla waradazhi kieliezho, "Eneshi kunni shenqi pusho, hudai shenqi wo!" <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/><char style="pn">Hherode</char> kunla kuaikui Hudade ese ogise Ezhanyi qienxien deigo faizhi ghugheighala zhou alaghawo.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Hudai kielien yebeiseye ondazhi xianxin giesan kunla olodozho. <verse eid="ACT 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/><char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Saolo</char>ghala renwune onchen giedene <char style="pn">Make</char> giesan <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>i uduru <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khareiwo.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Shenlin Banaba Saolo Ghualai Sunghudene Peizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>
    <char style="png">Anqiya</char>ni jiohuide giedun xienzhi, loushi wine. <char style="pn">Banaba</char>, heiren giesan <char style="pn">Ximien</char>, <char style="png">Gulinai</char> kun <char style="pn">Luqiu</char>, <char style="pn">Hherode</char> onghala hhantu fugiedasan <char style="pn">Manien</char>, pse <char style="pn">Saolo</char> wo. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Hhela Ezhanyi beiizhi orozo bareikude Shenlin kieliewo, "Ta <char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i sunghudene made jie. Bi hhelai uruzhi wiliene gieghane." <verse eid="ACT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Ingie hhela orozo bareizhi onxian giedene hhelai jiere khane teizhi peizhi echighawo.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Banaba Saolo Saipuluside Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Hhelai Shenlin peizhi <char style="png">Xiliuji</char>de boughadene hhense chon souzhi <char style="png">Saipulusi</char> daode kuruwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Hhende <char style="png">Salami</char> geidoude echi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai huitanlade Hudai kielienyi jianjizho. <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> hhelade banman giezho.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Hhela <char style="png">Saipulusi</char> nie daoni yozhi zuihoude <char style="png">Pafu</char>de irewo. Hhende nie fashu shuaisan kunyi penjiwo. Hheshi nie xienzhii maochun giesan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo. Niereini <char style="pn">Bayesu</char> giene. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Hhe kun <char style="pn">Shiqiu-Baolo</char> giesan zunlighala jiodao daizho. <char style="pn">Shiqiu-Baolo</char>shi nie aghelitu kun wo, hhe <char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Saolo</char>ghalai xinlazhi ire Hudai kielienyi chenliene giezho. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/><char style="pn">Ilima</char> <char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Saolo</char>ghalai jiohorozhi zunlii ene xinyanni ulie xianxin gieghane giezho. <char style="pn">Ilima</char>i isishi fashu shuaisan kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> giesan <char style="pn">Saolo</char>de Shenlin durudene hhei aralazhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>"Chishi Ibilisini kewon wo. Chi yanyanji gounii fandui giezho. Chade yanyanji piendakui doghunni duruzho. Chi Ezhanni zhendaoni wirulaghakui da ulie beinu? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Ede Ezhan chii faise chi sugho gholuzhi zhanshi jiere naranyi chanla dane!" Ingiese nudunni deigo borolozhi kharaladene simiendene moqioluzhi mo uduruku kun ereizho. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Zunli ene fashen giesan shiqinyi chanladene Ezhanyi daoli ghudure wo giezhi xianxin giewo.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anqiyani Bixijide Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char>tan <char style="png">Pafu</char>se chon souzhi <char style="png">Panfeiliya</char>ni <char style="png">Biejia</char>de irewo. <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> hhelase likai gie <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char>tan <char style="png">Biejia</char>se likai giedene yozhi <char style="png">Bixiji</char>ni <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de irewo. Hhamuraku udude huitande orozhi souwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Guijinshu, xienzhishui onshi baraghadene huitan gonjisan kunla kun peizhi hhelade kielieghawo, "Gaijiula, kunlade yan surughaku kielien bise kielie."<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> bosizhe khane nie zhadeigha kieliewo, "<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla, pse Hudai zunjisan niman kunla, chenliendu! <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Ene <char style="png">Isilie</char>ni Huda mai xienrenlai sunghuzho. Hhela <char style="png">Aiji</char>de soukude Huda hhelai hendaghazhi fugie nenlighalane <char style="png">Aiji</char>se uduruzhi khizhewo. <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Hontande hhelai 40 nien rennai giezho. <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/><char style="png">Jianan</char> oronni dolon minzui widaghazhi hhe oronyi hhelade ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Enezighan shiqinla chabudu 450 nien olune. Khuinashi Huda hhelade panjiku noyen ogizhi izhi <char style="pn">Samuer</char> xienzhii shihou kuruwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Ene shihoude hhela Hudase nie honshan kerewo. Ingie Huda <char style="pn">Bienyamin</char> pai dundadedu <char style="pn">Jishi</char>ni kewon <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i hhelade 40 nien honshan danlaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Saolo</char>i widaghadene <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni hhelade honshan danlagha, hhende oluzhi kieliewo, 'Bi ereisan <char style="pn">Yexi</char>ni kewon <char style="pn">Dawude</char> made talazho. Hhe mii jihuai chengun olughane.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>"Huda dain giesan mutun <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni houdeise <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlade nie jiuichen <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i khizheghawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Hhe iretula <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> jien <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunlade, "Geizhen giedene xilini jienlie." giezhi chonjizho. <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/><char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> renwune onchen giekude kieliewo, 'Ta sumulase bishi kien wo? Bishi hhe pusho. Hhe mii khuinase irene. Bi hhende mahei deizi andaghaseye pei dane.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>"Gaijiula, <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char>ni houdeila, pse Hudai zunjisan niman kunla, ene jiuiku daolishijiu matande ogisanwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/><char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de sousan kun, hhelai lindaola <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i tani dazho. Hhela niefanie hhamuraku udude onshisan xienzhii kielienyi dunjire dazhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de zui jinjise xienzhila kieliesan mutun gholuwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Hhende yama fuguku zui ereizhi oludawoma, hhela <char style="pn">Bilado</char>i xiahua giezhi hhei ala giewo. <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Ingiezhi jinwun jiere hhei zhiizhi kieliesanla man gholuwo. Ingiedene hhei mutun jierese agi bouzhe mezade teiwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Ingieliuzhe Huda hhei fugusan kun dundase aminne olughawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char>ghala hhantu <char style="png">Jialili</char>se <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khisan kunlade <char style="pn">Ersa</char> ezighancha xienjighawo. Hhela ede bexinlai dunda <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de ganzhen beizho. <verse eid="ACT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>Bijienye ene gouxioxini tande chonjizhi ogine. Eneshi Huda matanyi xienrenlade dain giesanwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/><char style="pn">Ersa</char>i aminne olughazhi matan houdei danlasan kunde chenjighawo. <char style="bk">Zeburei</char> ji 2 piende jilasan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">'Chishi mii kewon wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">Enedu bi chade ada danlawo.'<verse eid="ACT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>Pse fugusan kun dundase <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i aminne olughazhi ulie fughaku shiqinde Huda ingiezhi kieliezhi daowo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">'Bi <char style="pn">Dawude</char>de ogisan zhigui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">kekaotu nenjienni tande ogiye.'<verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>Da nie <char style="bk">Zeburei</char> jiereye kieliewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:35">'Chi zhiguitu kunne ulie fughane.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>"<char style="pn">Dawude</char> duyade bikude Hudai isii zunjizhoma, duya ijiedene xienrenlareni hhantu bulase fuwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Zinie Huda aminne olughasan hhe ese fuwo."<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>"Ingiese gaijiula, ta mejiendu. Ene kunyi tungo giezhi zuini mienlieku daolii tande chonjizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/><char style="pn">Musa</char>i guijinghala giese gounide sana danema, <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giesan kunlai man yanseliuzhe gounide sanane. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Ingiese ta xioxin gie, pse xienzhila kieliesan tai jiere gholune.<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>'Uzhe, ta uzhezhi xiniesan kunla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">jindazhi fugune.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Bi tai xienzide kunla tande kielieliuzhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ta xianxin gie daku fugie shiqin giene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ingiese ta ayidene fugune.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala huitanse khizhekude kunla hhelai xinlazhi pse nie hhamuraku udude enezighan kielienyi hhelade pse jianji giezho. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Sanhui giedene olon <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, Yutaijioni suisan niman kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghalai daghazho. Hheghala hhelade Hudai nenjiende chan kouizhi gie giezhi jianjizhi goude kieliewo.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Pse nie hhamuraku udude nie chenshini kunla man hhantulazhi ire Ezhanyi kielienyi chenliene giezho. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla imeghei kun iresei chanladene dubiliezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliesan kielienyi fandui giezhi sugiezho.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala danzine fugiedaghazhi kieliewo, "Hudai kielienyi xien tande kieliese indanji woma, ta ene daolii ulie jienliene. Ta goyane ene chanqiku aminni pei dane giezhi jiejin giezho. Ingiese bijien niman kunlai hhende echine. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Ezhan bijiende ingiezhi fenfulawo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">'Bi chii niman kunlade gon gholughadene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">jiuiku nenjienni deilazhi duyani uzhude echigha giezhi jinjiwo.'"<verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Niman kunla ene kielienyi chenliesenu bayasuzhi Ezhanyi kielien gou wo giezho. Chanqiku aminni ogine giezhi jinjisan kunla man xianxin giewo.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Ingiese Hudai kielienyi hhe oronde chonji kurughawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla Hudai beiisan minshentu biereilai, pse hhe chenshii zhanlaolai shanjizhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghalai heizhi oronsene tou khighawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Hheghala kunlai fandui giezhi kon jieredu turane kui boughadene <char style="png">Igenien</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Tujilade bayasuku, Shenlin duruzho.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Banabaghala Igeniende Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Xianxianji shiqin <char style="png">Igenien</char>deye gholuwo. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai huitande orozhi daolii goude jianjise olon <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Xila</char> kunla xianxin giewo. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Ulie shunjisan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla niman kunlai shanjizhi gaijiulade doghunni sumulaghazho. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Ingiese hheghala hhende oloncha souzhi Ezhande oluzhi danzine fugiedagha giezhi kieliezho. Ezhan hhelade nenli ogizhi ghudureqi, fugie shiqin giedene hhela jianjisan Hudai nenjientu daolide ganzhen beizho. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Ingiese chenshini kunla lianbanzi gholudene ibanlie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunyi daghazho, pse ibanlie shitulai daghazho.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Niezhan niman kunla, <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla, noyenlarene hhantuladene ghua shitulai zayalazhi tashighala eghine giezhi jiejin giewo. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Shitula ene shiqinni mejiedene holuzhi <char style="png">Ligaoni</char>ni <char style="png">Luside</char>, <char style="png">Tebi</char> ghua chenshide, pse zhouwini oronlade echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Hhela hhe oronlade gouxioxini chonjizho.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Luside Tebi Ghua Oronde Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>
    <char style="png">Luside</char>de ghua konde lilian witu nie canfei souzho. Zhayaghasanse mo yozhi ese daozho. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> jianjisanyi hhe kun chenliezho. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhei goude uzhese hhende goudaku xianxin gieku zhughe wine. <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>Ingie fugiede kieliewo, "Chi ghua konne zhidaghazhi bosizhe!" Ingiese hhe kun jiuli bosi ire yo qiiwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Olon kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char> giesan shiqinyi chanladene <char style="png">Ligaoni</char>i kielienghala fugiede kieliewo, "Nigiedala kun gholudene mai dunda irewo!" <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Banaba</char>i <char style="pn">Zhousi</char> giezhi uruzho. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> zhomen jianjise <char style="pn">Xiermi</char> giezhi uruzho. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Chenshi ghadaneshiku <char style="pn">Zhousi</char> mioni buwa giedun fughe laizhi chizhe bareidene chenshi wijien melie irewo. Olon kunlare hhantu shitulade khughozhi beiine giezho. <verse eid="ACT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/><char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>ghala sonosudene jienne sidakeigha, olon kunlai dunda holu oro fugiede kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>"Dajiala, ta yale intu shiqin giene? Bijienshiye kun wo, tanre niekielien wo. Bijien enende irezhi gouxioxii chonjikushi tai gou witu dunxilase likai gieghazhi asiman, zemin, hai, pse hhei sudorodu shihenilai man zhayaghasan zhenzhenji chanqiku Hudade shunjighane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>Eqighanku gonyinde Huda go minzulani durare teizhi yan giese gie giezho. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Ingieliuzhe Huda gou shiqin giezhi goyane chan zhenmin giezho. Asiman jierese ghura bouzheghazhi, nanshihoude yanyanji osighazhi, tai chudughadene zhughede bayasughazho." <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Shitula ene kielienyi kieliedene olon kunlai danlazhi beigha dazhi ingiezhi goyane seigie ese beiighawo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Niezhan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="png">Anqiya</char>se <char style="png">Igenien</char>se ire olon kunlai kielie shundagha <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i tashighala eghi, hhe fuguwo giedene chenshi ghadane lai khighawo. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Tujila <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i kanzide wiqi beise hhe bosi ire chenshide orowo. Khuichudu hhe <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala hhantu <char style="png">Tebi</char>de echiwo.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xiliyani Anqiyade Khareizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Hhela <char style="png">Tebi</char>de gouxioxii chonjidene olon kunlai tuji gholughawo. Ingiedene hhela <char style="png">Luside</char>, <char style="png">Igenien</char>ni jingo giezhi <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de khareiwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Hhela tujilai zhugheini khiduzheghazhi izhi xianxin gie giezhi sughazhi kieliezho. "Matan Hudai gojiade orone giese bixi olon ku shouine." <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Hhela go jiohuide zhanlaolai sunghudene ese ijiezhi onxian gie, hhelai xianxin giesan Ezhandei jiuizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Ingie ghuala <char style="png">Bixiji</char>ni jingo giezhi <char style="png">Panfeiliya</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Pse <char style="png">Biejia</char>de Hudai kielienyi jianjidene <char style="png">Yadali</char>de bouwo. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Hhense chon souzhi <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de khareiwo. <char style="png">Anqiya</char>shi chonjiku wiliede oluzhi ghua shitulai Hudai nenjiende jiuizhi ogisan oron wo. Ede onchen giedene khareizhi irewo. <verse eid="ACT 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/><char style="png">Anqiya</char>de kurudene jiohuini kunlai man uru ire Huda hhelai tungo giezhi matugie giesan shiqinlai, pse Huda niman kunlai xianxin gie qiighasei kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Hhela hhende tujilare hhantu oloncha souwo.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Yelusalende Hui Keizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>
    <char style="png">Yudaya</char>se bouzhesan giedun kunla gaijiulade <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni guijinghala hetoune ulie giese jiui dane giezhi sughazho. <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala hhelare hende jianjiduzhi zhenjinduse jiohuini kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Banaba</char>, pse giedun kunlai ene shiqinde <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni shitu, zhanlaolade asaghale echine giezhi jiejin giewo.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Ingiese jiohuini kunla hhelai khughowo. Hhela <char style="png">Feiniji</char>, <char style="png">Samaliya</char>ni daokude niman kunla <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giesei kieliese hhendedu gaijiula man hende bayasuzho. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/><char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de kuruse shitu, zhanlao, jiohuini kunla hhelai jienliewo. Huda hhelare hhantu giesan shiqinlai man jiohuini kunlade kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Giedun Falisai paini <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin giesan kunla bosizhedene kieliewo, "Niman kunlai bixi hetoune gieghadene fenfulazhi <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni guijinni zunjighakuni wo."<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Shitu, zhanlaola hhantulazhi ene shiqinni shanlian giewo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Dajiala ene shiqinni oloncha jianjidudene <char style="pn">Beduru</char> bosizhe kieliewo, "Gaijiula, Huda melieshida tani dundase mii sunghuzhi niman kunla mase gouxioxini chenliedene xianxin giesei ta mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>Kunyi zhugheni mejiechen Huda matande ogisan mutun niman kunladeye Shenlinni ogizhi hhelai jienliewo. <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Dou xianxin giekughala hhelani zhughei ganjinraghawo. Hhelai uzheku matanre niekielien wo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Ede ta yale Hudai shiizhi matan, matanyi xienrenla lai daku jiabanni tujilai ghuzhun jiere zhoghane? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Ulie olune, matanyi jiuikushi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i nenjienghala wo. Hhelaye niekielien wo. Bijien ingiezhi xianxin giezho."<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Olon kunla man yama shenqi uye khizhezhi Huda <char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>ghalai tungo giezhi niman kunlai dunda giesan ghudureqi, fugie shiqinlai chenliezho. <verse eid="ACT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Hhela kielie baludene <char style="pn">Yagebu</char> kieliewo, "Gaijiula, mii kielienyi chenliendu. <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Huda matugiezhi niman kunlai zhaogu giezhi tou 1 hui hhelani dundase bexinlai sunghudene goyanughun gholughasei <char style="pn">Ximien</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">15:14</char> <char style="ft" closed="false">Bedurui dounie niere </char></note> kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Eneshi xienzhila kieliesan kielienghala niekielien wo. Jinwun jiere huaizho,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>'Enense khuinashi bi khareizhi iredene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="pn">Dawude</char>ni furasan gieni erchan bosizheghane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Tairesanni gie goudaghazhi erchan bosizheghane.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17"/>Ingiese feiliesan kunlai man Ezhanyi ereighane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">Bi sunghuzhi goyanughun gholughasan niman kunlai man Ezhanyi ereighane.<verse eid="ACT 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18"/>Eneshi dei qiikude ene shiqinlai</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:18">mejieghasan Ezhan kieliesan wo.'<verse eid="ACT 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>Ingiese bi uzhese Hudade shunjisan niman kunlade chijia bu teidene <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>hhelade xin huaizhi nigiedade ogidene zannanshisan, lon kijieku, lei alasan, chusun, enelase gholodo giezhi fenfulase oluzho. <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Ingiekushi eqighanse izhi go chenshide <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni guijinni jianjichen kun wine. Niefanie hhamuraku udude huitande onshizho."<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xianxin Giesan Niman Kunlade Xin Huaizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Ingiedene shitu, zhanlao, jiohuini kunla hhelai dundase kun sunghuzhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Banaba</char>re hhantu <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de echighane giezhi jiejin giewo. Sunghusan kunshi <char style="pn">Basaba</char> giesan <char style="pn">Yuda</char>, pse <char style="pn">Seila</char> wo. Ene ghualashi jiohuini zhanlao wo. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Ingie hhelade bareighasan xin jiere kieliezho, "<char style="pn">Ersa</char>i sudoro gaijiu danlasan shitu, zhanlaola <char style="png">Anqiya</char>, <char style="png">Xiliya</char>, <char style="png">Jilijia</char>dedu xianxin giesan niman gaijiulade kielien asazho."<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>"Bijien sonosuse bijienni enense giedun kun khizhi echi kielienghala tai jiohoro giezhi tande nanran ese ogizho. Shijishan bijien hhelade yama ese fenfulazho. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Ingie dajiala tunyigie giedun kun sunghu peizhi bijien oresan <char style="pn">Banaba</char>, <char style="pn">Baolo</char>re hhantu tai hhende echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Ene ghualashi mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihade oluzhi aminne ulie kerechen kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Ingiese bijien <char style="pn">Yuda</char>, <char style="pn">Seila</char>ghalai peizhi tande qinsi ene shiqinlai kielieghane. <verse eid="ACT 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>Shenlin bijienre hhantu tunyi giezhi ene giedun zhunyoni shiqinse chugo psedu achanni tai jiere ulie teise gou wo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Ta nigiedade teisan, chusun, lei alasan, lon kijieku enelase gholoduse jiu oluwo. Tande salan gieye."<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Hhelani peizhi <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de bou, xianxin giesan kunlai uruzhi hhantulagha xinni jiuizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Xinni onshidene zhichi giesan goushi hhela bayasuzho. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/><char style="pn">Yuda</char>, <char style="pn">Seila</char>ghalashiye xienzhi wo. Olon kielienghala gaijiulade surughazhi hhelai xianxin giekuni khiduzheghawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Hhela hhende nietan soudene gaijiula hhelai dafalazhi hhelai peizhi ireghasan <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni jiohuide pinnande echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char>, <char style="pn">Banaba</char>ghala <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de zhanshi souzhi olon kunlare hhantu kunlade sughazhi Ezhanyi kielienyi chonjizho.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Banabaghala Ghaghachazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Giedudu daodene <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Banaba</char>de kieliewo, "Matan khareizhi eqighandei Ezhanni kielienyi chonjisan go chenshide gaijiulani qinkonyi uzhele yoye." <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/><char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Make</char> giesan <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ni uduruzhi echine giese <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/><char style="pn">Make</char> eqighandei <char style="png">Panfeiliya</char>se likai giezhi hhelare hhantu wilie ese giewo giezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhei jiedui ulie udurune giezho. <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Ingie ghuala hende jianjindu ghaghachawo. <char style="pn">Banaba</char> <char style="pn">Make</char>i uduru chon soudene <char style="png">Saipulusi</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>i sunghusenu gaijiula hhelai Ezhanni nenjiende jiuizhi ogise yo qiiwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Xiliya</char>ni, <char style="png">Jilijia</char>ni yozhi go jiohuilani khiduzheghawo.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Qimotai Baolo Seilaghalare Hhantulazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Tebi</char>de echi, pse <char style="png">Luside</char>de kuruse hhende nie tuji wine. Niereini <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> giene. Ananishi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo, Ezhanyi xianxin giezho. Adanishi <char style="png">Xila</char> kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/><char style="png">Luside</char>, <char style="png">Igenien</char>ni gaijiula man <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ni kuaizho. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhei uduruzhi echine giezho. Hhe oronni <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla adanishi <char style="png">Xila</char> kun bikui man mejiene. Ingie hhende hetoune giewo. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Hhela go chenshilai yozhi daokude <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni shitu, zhanlaola jinjisan guijinni xianxin giesan kunlade ogizhi zunjighazho. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Ingiese jiohuilani kunlai xianxin gieku khiduzhezhi kun niudunie olodowo.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Maqidun Kunni Zhoujin Mutun Chanlazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Shenlin hhelai danlazhi <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>de Hudai kielienyi ese jianjighase hhela <char style="png">Fulijia</char>, <char style="png">Jialatai</char> oronlade echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/><char style="png">Meixiya</char>ni bienzide kurudene <char style="png">Bituini</char>de echine giese <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i ruhher ese echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Ingiese hhela <char style="png">Meixiya</char>ni jingo giezhi <char style="png">Teloya</char>de bouwo. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Xienidei <char style="pn">Baolo</char> zhoujin mutun chanlawo. Niekozi <char style="png">Maqidun</char> kun beidene hhei xiahua giezhi kieliewo, "<char style="png">Maqidun</char>de daozhedene bijiende banman gie." <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> zhoujin mutun chanlase bijien deigo <char style="png">Maqidun</char>de echine giezho. Bijien jiejin giese Huda bijienyi uruzhi hhe oronni kunlade gouxioxini chonjighane giezho.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feilibide Lijiya Ezhanni Xianxin Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Ingiese bijien <char style="png">Teloya</char>se chon souzhi zhijie <char style="png">Samotela</char>de echidene khuichudu <char style="png">Niyapoli</char>de kuruwo. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Hhense <char style="png">Feilibi</char>de kuruwo. <char style="png">Feilibi</char>shi <char style="png">Maqidun</char> orondedu nie zhunyo chenshi wo, <char style="png">Loma</char> gonjizho. Bijien ene chenshide giedudu souwo.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Hhamuraku udude bijien chenshini wijiense khirei nie moron bienzide echiwo. Sumulase hhende nie onxian gieku oron wine giezho. Bijien soudene hhantulasan biereilade daoli jianjiwo. <verse eid="ACT 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Chenliesan kun dunda <char style="png">Tuiyatuila</char> chenshini nie zihun bosi huisan bierei wo. Niereini <char style="pn">Lijiya</char> giene. Hhe Hudai beiizho. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> jianjikude Ezhan hheni zhugheni keighase hhe goude chenliezho. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Hhe bierei, pse nie gie kunladeni man xili gieghawo. Ingie bijienyi xiahua giezhi kieliewo, "Ta bishi Ezhanni zhenzhenji xianxin giesan wo giese mii giede yodene sou." Ingie bijienyi ninguru danlawo.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Seilaghalani Bareizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Niefade bijien onxian gieku oronde echikude nie sheitan heisan hoji oqin irewo. Hhe fashu shuaizhi loubanladene baer olon ireghazho. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Ene oqin <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, pse bijienyi daghadene onghonozhi kieliewo, "Enezighan kunlashi Zui Undu Hudai hojila wo. Hhela tande jiuiku daolini chonjine!" <verse eid="ACT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Hhe ingiezhi ezighancha onghonose <char style="pn">Baolo</char> pofensadene ochira daozhe sheitande kieliewo, "Bi <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani niereghala chii fenfulaye, hhei jierese khizhe!" Hhe sheitan danshi khizhewo.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Hoji oqinni loubanla uzhese baer ireku xiwon widase <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>ghalai bareidene geidoude khirei noyenyi shida lai echighawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Hhelai laidene noyenlai shida ire kieliewo, "Enezighan kunlashi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo, mai chenshini daolon giezho. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Hhela matan <char style="png">Loma</char> kunla jienlie dazhi gie daku jiomun chonjizho."<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Olon kunlaye hhantuladene hhelai fandui giezho. Panjiku noyenla fenfulazhi hhelai jienni teighadene banbanghala eghi giezho. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Hhelai hende eghidene bafanzide khawo. Sagheisan kunde goude uzhe giezhi fenfulawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Sagheisan kun ene minlinni jienliedene hhelani zui jizii bafanzide khazhi ghua kon jierei jieliu zhoghawo.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sagheisan Kun Nie Giechilie Xianxin Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Banye olukudeni <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>ghala onxian giezhi Hudade doulazho. Fanrenlaye chenliezho. <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Menzhali zemin hende gojiolu bafanzi jiziye gojioluwo. Ingie bafanzi wijienla man kei echi soyuji fanrenlani jieliu man andawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Sagheisan kun xiereise bafanzi wijienla man keise fanrenla man holuwo giedene khudoghone choui khizhe goyane fugune giezho. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Ingiekude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> fugiede waradazhi kieliewo, "Goyane bu shanji! Bijien man enende wo!"<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Sagheisan kun zhulai kerezhi ire, jiuli bou, pugharazhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>ni melie papalawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Ingie hhelani uduru khizhe kieliewo, "Gujiula, bi matugiese jiuine?"<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Hhela kieliewo, "Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni xianxin gie. Ingiese chi, chii nie giechiliei man jiuine." <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Ingie Ezhanni kielienyi hhei nie giechiliede jianjizhi chenlieghawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Yen hhe xii hhe shihoude sagheisan kun hhelani uduruzhi echi shankoulaini waghazhi ogiwo. Ingiedene hhe nie giechiliede man xili gieghawo. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Ingie sagheisan kun hhelai uduruzhi giedene echi budan ijieghawo. Hhe nie giechilie Hudai xianxin giese hende bayasuzho.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Khuichudu ogheise noyenla gunnanjilai peizhi iregha "Hhe ghua kunyi andagha." giezhi kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Ingiese sagheisan kun <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de kieliewo, "Panjiku noyenla tai andagha giezhi minlin xiaiwo. Ede ta khidene pinnande echi." <verse eid="ACT 16:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Bijienshi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun wo. Bijiende zui ese jinjidene olon kunlai melie bijienni eghizhi dou bafanzide khawo. Ede bijienni zhonmenji andaghanu? Ene ulie olune. Hhela goyalane irezhi bijienni uduzhi khireigha gie." <verse eid="ACT 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Gunnanjila ene kielienyi noyenlade kieliese noyenla hhelashi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun wo giese ayizho. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Ingiedene ire hhelai sidaghazhi kielie, uduruzhi khizhedene, "Hhe chenshise likai gie!" giezhi xiahua giewo. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Ghuala bafanzise khizhedene <char style="pn">Lijiya</char>ni giede echi gaijiulai ochira, zhichi giedene yolawo.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Qiesalonijiade Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>ghala <char style="png">Anfeipoli</char>, <char style="png">Yaboloniya</char>ni daodene <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char>de irewo. Hhende <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni nie huitan wine. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> suchanku xigonghala hhende orozhi lienji ghuran hhamuraku udude kunlare jinwun kielienduzho. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Mexiha bixi shouku giedene fugusan kun dundase aminne olukui hhelade jianjizhi zhenmin giezho. Pse kieliewo, "Bi tande chonjizhi ogisan ene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shijiu Mexiha wo." <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Hhelai dunda ezighan kunlai kielie shundaghase <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>i daghazho. Pse Hudai beiisan olon <char style="png">Xila</char> kun, minshentu biereilaye olon daghazho.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Xianxin ulie giechen <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla dubiliezhi geidouse ezighan liumanlai uruzhi hhantulagha nie chenshii kunlai shanjidene <char style="pn">Yaso</char>ni giede chunji oro, <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char> ghualai ereizhi bexinlade jiuine giezho. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Ereizhi olu dadene <char style="pn">Yaso</char>, giedun gaijiulai laisenu hhe oronni noyenyi shida echi waradazhi kieliewo, "Qienxiani daolon giesan ene iban kunla enende irezho. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/><char style="pn">Yaso</char> giedene hhelai jienliewo. Enezighan kunla man <char style="pn">Ersa</char> giechen da nie honshan wine giezhi <char style="pn">Kaisa</char>i minlinyi fanjizho." <verse eid="ACT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Olon kunla hhe oronni noyenla ene kielienyi chenliedene jindazho. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Ingiedene <char style="pn">Yaso</char>, psedu kunlai baer faidene andaghawo.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biliyade Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Xienidei gaijiula <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="pn">Seila</char>ghalai deigo <char style="png">Biliya</char>de echighawo. Ghuala kudene <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai huitande echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/><char style="png">Biliya</char>ni kunla <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char> kunlase sixian keifan giezho. Daolini rexinde jienliezhi niudunie xianxide jinwunni chaizhi ene daoli oluzhou ese oluzho giezho. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Ingie hhelai dunda olon kun xianxin giewo. <char style="png">Xila</char>ni minshentu bierei, ere kunlaye choghon uwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/><char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char>ni <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Biliya</char>de Hudai kielienyi chonjisei mejiedene hhende echizhi kunlai shanjizhi londaghazho. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Ingiese gaijiula deigo <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i haibienzide echighawo. <char style="pn">Seila</char> <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ghala yen <char style="png">Biliya</char>de feiliewo. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char>i khughosan kunla hhei khughozhi <char style="png">Yajien</char>de echighawo. Hhela khareikude <char style="pn">Seila</char> <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ghala ghujighande mii enende ire giezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> fenfulasei deila echiwo.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yajiende Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Yajien</char>de hhelai sagheikude nie chenshide man nigiedashi hende nango giezho. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Hhe huitan sudoro <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, Hudai beiisan niman kunlare jianjinduzho. Pse niudunie geidoude penjisan kunlare jianjiduzho. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Da niezhan Ibijiulu, Sidoya ghua paini loushilaye <char style="pn">Baolo</char>re jianjinduzhi kieliezho, "Ene hulihuduji yan kieliezho?" Pse niezhanla kieliezho, "Hhe hoxianshi niman kunlai nigiedani chonjizho." Ingiezhi kieliekushi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelade <char style="pn">Ersa</char> fuho giesan daolii jianjizho. <verse eid="ACT 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Ingiese hhela <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uduru <char style="png">Yaliebagu</char> fayende echidene kieliewo, "Chi jianjisan ene nie shini daolini bijiende mejieghase olulie? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Chi kieliesan niezhan shiqinlai bijien chenliese ghudure no wo. Eneshi yan isi bikui bijien mejieku duran wine." <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/><char style="png">Yajien</char> kun, hhende zhanshi jiere sousan waiji kunla man yama ulie gonjidene zui shini shiqinyi chenliezhi kieliekude xiqi wo.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Yaliebagu</char> fayende beidene kieliewo, "<char style="png">Yajien</char> kunla, bi uzhese ta yan gieliuzhe zunjio xinyan jiere chighara wo. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Bi gochude yokude ta beiisanlai xianxide uzhese nie sidagha gieku teizi jiere, 'Tani Daku Hudade' giezhi huaizho. Ingiese ta tani dazhi beiisei bi kielieye."<verse eid="ACT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>"Hheshi duya, duya jieredu yanyanjilai man zhayaghasan Huda wo. Asiman zeminni Ezhan wo. Kun giesan huitande ulie soune. <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>Hhende chaiku mutun kunni khaghala ushilaku biyo uwo. Huda kunlade amin, ho, yanyanjilai man ogizho. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Niekozi kunse jien minzulani zhayaghadene zeminyi gochude soughawo. Hhelade nienjien, souku oronni jinjizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>Ingiezhi giekushi Huda goyane kunlai ereighane giezho. Kenen moqioluzhi hhei ereizhi olune. Shijishan Huda matan alinie kunseliuzhe gholo uwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>'Matan amituraku, gojioluku, bikushi man hhei kouizho.' Tai dunda shu huaisan kunla kieliesan mutun, 'Matanshi Hudase iresan wo.'"<verse eid="ACT 17:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>"Matan Hudase iresanshi Hudai antan, miengu, tashighala, kunni jishu, sumulakughala giesan yanzi mutun uzhese ulie olune. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Melieshida kunla mejie dazhi giesei ese gonjiwoma, ede Huda gochui kunlade fenfulazhi geizhen gie giezho. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Huda sunghusan hhe kunghalane duyai gundande panjiku udui ijin jinji goudaghawo. Hhe kunyi fugusan kun dundase aminne olughazhi soyuji kunlade xianxin gieku zhenmin ogiwo."<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Fugusanse fuho giesan ene kielienyi chenliedene niezhanla hhei uzhezhi xiniezho, niezhanla "Bijien pse chenlieku duran wine." giezhi kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai dundase khizhi echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Niezhan kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char>re hhantulazhi Ezhanni xianxin giewo. Hhelai dunda <char style="png">Yaliebagu</char> fayendedu nie kun <char style="pn">Jiunixiu</char>, <char style="pn">Damali</char> giesan nie bierei, da ezighan kunye wine.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Gelindode Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Ene shiqinse khuinashi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Yajien</char>se likai giedene <char style="png">Gelindo</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Hhende <char style="png">Bendu</char>de olusan nie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunyi penjiwo. Niereini <char style="pn">Yajila</char> giene. <char style="pn">Kelaoji</char> honshan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade <char style="png">Loma</char> gojiase likai gie giezhi minlin xiaise <char style="pn">Baijila</char> giesan biereighalane ene oloncha <char style="png">Loma</char>ni <char style="png">Idali</char>se irewo. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai ochirale echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>Hhelaye <char style="pn">Baolo</char> mutun zhanfan giezhi udu daoghazho. Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelare hhantu souzhi wilie giezho. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Niefanie hhamuraku udude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> huitande kunlare jianjinduzhi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Xila</char> kunlai kielie shundaghane giezho.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>
    <char style="pn">Seila</char>, <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>ghala <char style="png">Maqidun</char>se iredene <char style="pn">Baolo</char> zhomen Hudai kielienyi chonjizhi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade, "<char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi Mexiha wo." giezhi ganzhen beizho. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Hhela fandui giezhi zannan kielienghala hhei sugiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> jien jieredu turane kuizhi kieliewo, "Ta goya zuine goya danji! Made yama ghadaghan uwo. Enedu khuinashi bi niman kunlai hhende echine."<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Ingiedene huitanse likai giezhi <char style="pn">Qido-Yushidu</char> giesan nie kunyi giede echiwo. Ene kun Hudai beiizho. Hhei gieni huitan konde wo. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Huitan gonjisan <char style="pn">Jilisibu</char> nie giechiliene Ezhanyi xianxin giewo. Pse olon <char style="png">Gelindo</char> kunlaye chenliedene xianxin giezhi xili jienliewo.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Xienidei Ezhan zhoujin mutun <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de kieliewo, "Bu ayi, amanne bu menjidene kielie. <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>Bi chighala hhantu wo. Kieme chii hei dane. Ene chenshide mii bexin olon wo." <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhende nienban souzhi Hudai kielienyi hhelade sughazho.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>
    <char style="pn">Jialiu</char> <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>de zunli danlakude <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla hhantuladene <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i fandui giezhi lai shenpantai melie echi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>"Ene kun guijinni ulie zunjidene Hudai beiise olune giezhi kunlai kielie shundaghazho."<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> jian kieliene giese <char style="pn">Jialiu</char> <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade kieliewo, "<char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla, fanfa giezhi yenzhunde zui fanjisan shiqinde zhazhoshi bi tanughunyi chenliese oluzhoma, <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>ta jianjindusanshi kielien, niere, tai guijinni shiqinshi ta goyalane banjile echi. Ene shiqinlani bi panjiku duran uwo." <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Ingiedene hhelai fayense tou khighawo. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Ingiese kunla man huitan gonjisan <char style="pn">Soqini</char>i barei agidene shenpantai melie idun eghiwo. Ingieliuzhe <char style="pn">Jialiu</char> ese gonjizho.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Xiliyani Anqiyade Echizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Gelindo</char>de pse ezighancha soudene gaijiulase ghaghachadene chon souzhi <char style="png">Xiliya</char>de echiwo. <char style="pn">Baijila</char>, <char style="pn">Yajila</char> hhere hhantu echiwo. Hhe <char style="png">Jiengeli</char>de usunne ghigha widaghawo. Enei hhe eqighanse fayen giezhi daozho. <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/><char style="png">Ifuso</char>de kurudene <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai hhende feiliegha goyane huitande orozhi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlare daoli jianjinduzho. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Kunla hhei pse giedudu sou giese hhe dain ese giedene <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>hhelase likai giekude kieliewo, "Huda duran bise bi pse tai enede irene." Ingie chon souzhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char>se likai giewo. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/><char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de chon jierese bouzhe, <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khireidene jiohuini kunlai nie asa, <char style="png">Anqiya</char>de bouwo.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Giedudu soudene pse likai gie, <char style="png">Jialatai</char>, <char style="png">Fulijia</char> oronlai yozhi olon tujilai khiduzheghawo.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yabolo Ifusode Daoli Jianjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>
    <char style="pn">Yabolo</char> giesan nie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de irewo. Hhei <char style="png">Yalishanda</char>de oluzho. Koucai wine, jinwunde hen wo. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>Ene kun Ezhanni daolini olon suruzho. Zhughe chilazhi <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i shiqinni kunlade xianxide sughazhoma, zinie <char style="pn">Yaheiya</char>ni xilini mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>Hhe huitande danzine fugiedaghazhi jianjizho. <char style="pn">Baijila</char>, <char style="pn">Yajila</char>ghala jianjiseini chenliedene hhei danlin uruzhi Hudai daolini hhende pse xianxide jianjizhi mejieghawo.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>
    <char style="pn">Yabolo</char> <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>de echine giese <char style="png">Ifuso</char>ni gaijiula hhende zhichi giedene <char style="png">Yagaiya</char>ni tujila <char style="pn">Yabolo</char>i goude jienlie giezhi xin huaizho. Hhe hhende kuruse Ezhanni nenjienghala xianxin giesan kunlade banman fugie wo. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Hhe olon kunlai melie jinwunghala <char style="pn">Ersa</char>shi Mexiha wo giezhi hende zhenmin giese <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai kielie beighawo.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Ifusode Echizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Yabolo</char> <char style="png">Gelindo</char>de bikude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> beimienghun yozhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de echiwo. Hhende giedun tujilai penjidene asawo, <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>"Ta xianxin giekude Shenlinyi jienliewoye?" Hhela kieliewo, "Uye, lien Shenlin winekuida chenliezhi ese daowo."<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Qinse ta yan xilini jienliewo?" Hhela kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> gieghasan xilini jienliewo." <verse eid="ACT 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Yaheiya</char> gieghasanshi geizhen gieku xili wo. Hhe bexinlade kieliezhi mii khuinase ireku hhei xianxin gie giezho. Hheshijiu <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo." <verse eid="ACT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Hhela ene kielienyi chenliedene Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala xili jienliewo. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai jiere khane teise Shenlin hhelai jiere bouzhewo. Ingiese hhela shiheni kielienghala kieliezhi Hudai kielienyi kielie qiiwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Hhende chabudu 12 gie kun wo.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> huitande orozhi danzine fugiedagha ghuran sara kunlare Hudai gojiai shiqinni jianjinduzhi kielie shundaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Ingieliuzhe niezhan kunla zhughene khiduzheghazhi ulie shunjidene olon kunlai melie ene daolini sugiene. Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> tujilarene hhantu hhelase likai giedene <char style="png">Tuilanu</char>ni suruku oronde niudunie jianjizhi kielienduzho. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Ingiezhi ghua honshi <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>de sousan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Xila</char> kunla man Ezhanni kielienyi chenliewo.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shijiwani Kewonla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Huda <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i tungo giezhi tebieji nenlitu shiqinlai gieghazho. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Niezhan kunla da hhe injizhi daosan shoujin, wiqinyini agi ire gientulai jiere teise gienla goudazhi sheitanla khizhi echiwo.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Gochude toreizhi sheitan tousan giedun <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala sheitanyi tou khighane giezhi sheitan heisan kunlade bi <char style="pn">Baolo</char> chonjisan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i niereghala tande minlin xiaiye giezhi shiizho. <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/><char style="pn">Shijiwa</char> giesan nie <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni fugie buwai dolon kewonla ene shiqinyi giezho. <verse eid="ACT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Ingiese sheitan hhelade kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Ersa</char>i bi mejiene. <char style="pn">Baolo</char>iye tanine. Tashi kien wo?" <verse eid="ACT 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Ingiedene sheitan heisan hhe kun hhelai jiere jiuli khirei, eghizhi hanshiliese hhela shan deilazhi hulan muchughun hhe giederase holu khireiwo.<verse eid="ACT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>
    <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de sousan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Xila</char> kunla man ene shiqinyi mejiedene ayizho. Ingiese Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i minshen fugiedawo. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Pse olon xianxin giesan kunla iredene goya giesanlane man chenren giezhi kielie khizheghawo. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Olon fashu shuaisan kunla shulai agizhi ire dajialai melie sideraghawo. Shuni jiageni sanase 50000 miengu wine. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Ingiezhi Ezhanyi kielien yebeiseye ondazhi gochude echizho.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifusode Londazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Ene shiqin daodene <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Maqidun</char>, <char style="png">Yagaiya</char> oronse daozhi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de echine giezhi zhughedene jiejin gie kieliewo, "Bi hhende kuruse bixi <char style="png">Loma</char>de nie uzhele echine." <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Ingie hhende banman giesan kun dundase <char style="pn">Qimotai</char>, <char style="pn">Iladu</char>ghalai <char style="png">Maqidun</char>de echighawo. Goyane zhanshi jiere <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>de feiliewo.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Hhe shihoude ene daolini yenyin jiere <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de hende londawo. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Nie miengu jianrenyi niereiini <char style="pn">Jimijiu</char> giene. Miengughala <char style="pn">Yajimi</char>ni yanzii giezhi jishugunlade baer olon zhenjighazho. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Hhe jishugun, hanjialane uruzhi hhantulaghadene kieliewo, "Dajiala, matan ene meimeighala facai giesei ta mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Ene <char style="pn">Baolo</char> zinie <char style="png">Ifuso</char>de pusho, <char style="png">Yaxiya</char> go oronlade olon kunlai miizhi kun khaghala giesanlashi Huda pusho giesei ta chujieghezhi sonosuwo. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Ingiese zinie matanyi ene meimeini minshen bixindaku pusho. <char style="pn">Yajimi</char> famatu bierei nigiedani mioniye kunla meilade uzhene. <char style="png">Yaxiya</char> kun, qienxiani kunla beiisan <char style="pn">Yajimi</char>ni wifen widane."<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Kunla chenliedene hende hokuzhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char> kunlai <char style="pn">Yajimi</char> hen wo giezhi onghonozho. <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Nie chenshi man londa qiiwo. Kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char>re hhantu yosan <char style="png">Maqidun</char>ni <char style="pn">Gaiyu</char>, <char style="pn">Yalidagu</char>i laidene xi yenjisan chanchande hhantu chunji orowo. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char>ye bexinlai dunda orone giese tujila ese oroghawo. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/><char style="png">Yaxiya</char>ni giedun noyenlashi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i zhanlien wo. Kun peizhi iregha <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i wixiennide bu echi giezhi danlawo.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Hhantulasan kunla londundunji wo. Ingiezhi onghonone, qingiezhi onghonone. Fugie olie kunla yangiezhi hhantulasanne ulie mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="pn">Yalishanda</char>i tungu melie khighase niezhan kunla hhende matugie giekui kieliezho. <char style="pn">Yalishanda</char> nie kha zhadeigha bexinlade jieshi giene giese <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>kunla hheshi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun bikui mejiedene man hhantu <char style="png">Ifuso</char> kunlai <char style="pn">Yajimi</char> hen wo giezhi ghua zhuntou onghonozho.<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Ingie hhe chenshini noyen ire olon kunla onghonosei beigha kieliewo, "<char style="png">Ifuso</char> kunlaya, <char style="png">Ifuso</char>shi hen <char style="pn">Yajimi</char> mioi sagheisan, pse asiman jierese bouzhesan tashii sagheisan chenshi bikui kien ulie mejiene? <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Ene shiqinde yama kieliekui uwoshi ta qioqioji lon bu ire. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Ta laizhi iresan enezighan kunla mioni dunxilai ese ghulazho. Pse mai bierei nigiedaniye ese sugiezho. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Jimijiu</char>, hhantuku jishugunlarene yan zhakui bise fayende nieniene zhale echi gie. Ede fayenni niezho, zunlilaye wine. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Tande psedu shiqin wineshi zhao guijinghala hui keizhi chuli gie. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Eneduku londasan shiqinde matanyi zhaku wixien wine. Ene saorao giesande matande jieshi gieku kielien uwo." <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>Ene kielienyi kieliedene qinzhunlai sandaghawo.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Maqidun, Xilade Echizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Ene londasan shiqin bouzhi echisenu <char style="pn">Baolo</char> tujilai uruzhi ire, hhelade sughazhi kielie, pse chujiegheye giedene <char style="png">Maqidun</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhe oronlai jingo giekude olon kielienghala tujilade sughazhi kieliedene <char style="png">Xila</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>Hhende ghuran sara soudene chon souzhi <char style="png">Xiliya</char>de zhen echine giekude <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla jihua giezhi hhei heine giekui mejie, <char style="png">Maqidun</char>ghun echine giezhi jiejin giewo. <verse eid="ACT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Hhere hhantu <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>de echisanshi <char style="png">Biliya</char> kun <char style="pn">Bilosi</char>ni kewon <char style="pn">Sobate</char> wo, <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char> kun <char style="pn">Yalidagu</char>, <char style="pn">Xigundu</char> ghuala wo, <char style="pn">Qimotai</char> pse <char style="png">Tebi</char> kun <char style="pn">Gaiyu</char> ghuala wo, da <char style="png">Yaxiya</char> kun <char style="pn">Tuijigu</char>, <char style="pn">Telofeimo</char> ghuala wo. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Enezighan kunla xien <char style="png">Teloya</char>de echi bijienyi sagheizho. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Bijien Tanmien Jie daodene <char style="png">Feilibi</char>se chon souzhi tawudushi <char style="png">Teloya</char> hhelai hhende kuru, doludu souwo.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Teloyade Zuihouku Niefa Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Xinqide bijien hhantuladene ginan ghuluzhi ijiekude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> khuichudu yolane giese hhelade banye olutula jianjiwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Bijien hhantulasan hhe lou jiere zhula olon wo. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> jianjikude <char style="pn">Yutuigu</char> giesan nie nasuchighan kun chongun jiere souzho. Oloncha jianjise hhe kun funtura fugudene 3 lou jierese anda bouwo. Kunla fei bosizheghase fuguzho. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> bou echi ghodeidene hhei qioru agi kieliewo, "Ta bu jinda, hhe dou amitu wo". <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> pse khizhi echi ginan ghuluzhi ijie, oloncha jianjizhi ogheidene yolawo. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Kunla nasuchighan kunyi amitu khugho echighase man hende bayasuzho.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Teloyase Milidude Echizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Bijien xien chon souzhi <char style="png">Yasho</char>de echi hhende <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i jienliene giezho. Hhe goyane yozhi echine giezho. Eneshi hhe nanpei giesan wo. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Yasho</char>de bijienre hhantulase bijien hhei chon jiere jienlie khirei <char style="png">Mituilini</char>de irewo. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Hhense chon souzhi khuichudu <char style="png">Jiya</char>ni duimiende kurudene da niudude <char style="png">Samo</char>de daowo. Ingie pse niudude <char style="png">Milidu</char>de irewo. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>de danwu giekuse ayizhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char>ni onji daone giezhi eqighanse jiejin giewo. Hhe ghujighan yozhi jinlianji 50 qienni jieqi melie <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de kune giezho.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Ifusoni Zhanlaolade Zuihouku Kielien Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Milidu</char>se kun peizhi <char style="png">Ifuso</char> jiohuini zhanlaolai xinlaghale echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Hhela irese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelade kieliewo, "Bi <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>se iresan hhe niuduse izhi tai dunda matugiezhi giesei ta mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla mii heizhi shouku gieghakude bi rennai giezhi goyane meilade uzhezhi nughusunghalane Ezhanyi zunjizhi giezho. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Tande oluzhi gounii bi nieda ese jiezhi olon kunlai melie pse kienyi giedeliuzhe tande sughazhi jianjiwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Pse <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, <char style="png">Xila</char> kunlade ganzhen beizhi Hudai melie geizhen giedene mai Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i xianxin gie giewo."<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>"Ede Shenlin mii biizhi bi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de echine. Hhende yan shiqin penjikui ulie mejienema, <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>bi mejiekushi Shenlin go chenshide made ganzhen beizhi bareiku pse kunnan kuzhene giezho. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Ingieliuzhe bi Hudai nenjienni kielieku gouxioxide ganzhen beine giezhi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>se jienliesan renwune onchen ulie gietula aminne ulie kerene."<verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>"Bi tai dunda irezhi Hudai gojiai daolii chonjizhoma, ihou ta mii pse chanla dakui ede bi mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Ingiese bi enedu tande ganzhen beiye. Tai dunda kien dozode echise made zui uwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Hudai isii bi goujida uye feilieghazhi man tande chonjizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>Ta goyalane xioxin giezhi zhaogu gie pse Hudai bexinlani xioxin giezhi zhaogu gie. Ta ghoni adulachen kun mutun hhelai zhaogu gie. Shenlin tai hhelade lindao danlaghazho. Hhelashi Huda Kewonne chusunghala agizhi iresan Hudani jiohui wo. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Bi yolase mouxien zhanghei tai dunda orezhezhi ghonilai shanjikui bi mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Tai dundaseye niezhan kunla khizhedene zhendaoni wirulaghazhi tujilai miidene goyalane daghaghane. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Ingiese xioxin giendu. Bi ene 3 niende xieni uduiji nughusun usuruzhi soyuji kunlade sughazhi kieliesei ta jila. <verse eid="ACT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>Ede bi tai Hudade, hhei nenjientu daolide jiuizhi ogiye. Ene daoli tai hendagha shidane, pse taiji soyuji zhiguishisan kunlare hhantu Hudai jiachanni jienliegha shidane. <verse eid="ACT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>Bi kiemai antan, miengu, jienni nienhei giezhi ese daozho. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Bi ghua khaghalane goyadene hhantuku kunladene injiku dunxi gunjisei ta goyalane mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Bi yandeliuzhe yanzi uzheghazhi khishulazhi wilie giedene zholien kunlade banman giezho. Pse ogiku jienliekuse fuqi fugiewo giesan Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i kielienyi jila giezho."<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> ene kielienyi kielie baraghadene xiutulie dajialare hhantu onxian giewo. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Kunla man fugiede wilazhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i qiorudene orezho. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>Ihou ta mii pse chanla dane giesan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i ene kielien hhelai zhughei hende otughazho. Ingie hhela <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i chon jiere khugho echighawo.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Yelusalende Echizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Bijien hhelase likai giedene chon souzhi zhijie <char style="png">Geshi</char>de kuruwo. Khuichudu <char style="png">Loji</char>de kurudene hhense <char style="png">Padala</char>de echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Hhende nie <char style="png">Feiniji</char> echiku chonyi penjidene chon jiere khirei yozhi qiiwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Ingie <char style="png">Saipulusi</char>yi chanla soghei miende jiedene <char style="png">Xiliya</char> fanxiande yozhi <char style="png">Tuilo</char>de kuruwo. Chon hhende ho xiine giezho. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Bijien hhende ezighan tujilai ereizhi oludene doludu souwo. Hhela Shenlinyi kouizhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de bu khirei giezhi kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Doludu daodene bijien yozhi qiiwo. Hhela bierei, kesilarene man bijienyi khughozhi chenshi ghadane ireghawo. Bijien haibienzide xiutulie onxian giedene <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>nieniedene feixin kieliewo. Bijien chon jiere khireise hhela gieladene khareiwo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Bijien izhi chon souzhi <char style="png">Tuilo</char>se <char style="png">Dolimai</char>de kuruwo. Hhendedu gaijiulade kielien asazhi hhelare niudu souwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Khuichudu bijien hhense likai gie <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de iredene gouxioxi chonjisan <char style="pn">Feili</char>i giede oro hhere hhantu souwo. Hheshi dolon kun dundadu nie wo. <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Hhende uye dafalasan jieran oqin wine. Hhelade Hudai kielien kielieku nenli wine. <verse eid="ACT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Bijien hhende ezighancha souse <char style="png">Yudaya</char>se nie xienzhi bouzhewo. Niereini <char style="pn">Yajiabu</char> giene. <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Bijienyi enende iredene <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i pixiei bareizhi goya kha, konne banladene kieliewo, "Shenlin ingiezhi kieliezho, '<char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de ene pixieni ezhanyi ingiezhi banladene niman kunlade jiuizhi ogine.'"<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Bijien ene kielienyi chenliedene hhe oronyi kunlare <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de bu khirei giezhi hende danlazho. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Ta yale ingiezhi wilazhi mii zhughei ghalughane? Bi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char>de oluzhi kunla mii banlazhi pse <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de fugughaliuzhe bi zhunbei gie goudazho." <verse eid="ACT 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Bijien <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i kieliezhi dao dase yama ese giedene zinie "Ezhanyi isi mutun gholu gie." giezhi kieliewo.<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Giedudu daodene bijien zhunbei gie <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khireiwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/><char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>ni giedun tujilaye bijienre hhantu echiwo. Hhela bijienyi uduruzhi <char style="pn">Nasun</char> giesan nie <char style="png">Saipulusi</char> kunyi giede echiwo. Hhe tuji danlazhi oloncha olune.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Yagebui Uzhele Echizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>
    <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de kuruse gaijiula bijienyi bayasuzhi jienliewo. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Khuichudu <char style="pn">Baolo</char> bijienre hhantu <char style="pn">Yagebu</char>i uzhele echiwo. Zhanlaolaye man hhende wine. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelade kielien asadene Huda hhei niman kunlai dunda gieghasan wilielai nienieji kieliezhi ogiwo.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Hhela chenliedene Hudai kuaizhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de kieliewo, "Gaijiu, chi mejiene. Ezhanyi xianxin giesan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun hao jiwon wine. Hhela <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni guijinde chighara no wo. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Hhela chenliese chi sughazhi niman kunlai dundadedu soyuji <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai <char style="pn">Musa</char>i guijinni bu zunjizhi ga kewosilade hetoune bu giegha giezho. Pse hhelai xigonni bu dagha giezho. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Ede matugiene? Kunla chi enende iresei mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>Chi zhao bijienyi kielien mutun giele echi. Bijienyi enende jieran kunla kielien yenji jiezho. <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Chi hhelare hhantu echizhi waghaku xigonghala hhantu wagha. Hhelai qiorun duliku baerni chi ogi. Ingiese hhela chenliesanshi zhenni pusho bikui, pse chi <char style="pn">Musa</char>i guijinni zunjisei dajiala mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>Bijien Ezhanni xianxin giesan niman kunlade nigiedade teisan, chusun, lei alasan, lon kijieku enelase gholodo giezhi jiejin giedene xin huaiwo."<verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhe jieran kunyi uduruzhi khuichudu waghaku xigonghala hhelare hhantu waghawo. Ingie mechide orodene hhela waghazhi baluku udui, pse jien kun Hudade mure ogiku uduni tunzhi giewo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baoloi Mechide Bareizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Hhe doludu barane giekude <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>se iresan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char> mechide bikui chanladene olon kunlai man shanjizhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i barei agiwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>Ingie waradazhi kieliewo, "<char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla, bijiende ishula! Ene kun gochude toreizhi jien kunlade mai kun, guijin, mechii fandui giezhi sughazho. Hhe da niman kunlai uduruzhi mechide oro ene zhiguitu oronyi zannanshighawo." <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Hhela ingiezhi kieliekushi <char style="png">Ifuso</char> kun, <char style="pn">Telofeimo</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>ghala chenshide bisei chanlasenu <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhei mechide uduru orowo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Nie chenshi man londazhi bexinla holu ire, <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i barei agidene mechise lai khireighawo. Ingie mechini wijienyi deigo kha jiewo. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Kunla zhen <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i alane giekude buduilani qienfuzhande <char style="png">Yelusalen</char> nie chenshi man londawo giezhi huibao giewo. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Ingie qienfuzhan deigo budui, giedun baifuzhanlai uduru holuzhi hhelai hhende bouwo. Hhela qienfuzhan, buduilai chanladene <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i eghiku beiwo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Ingie qienfuzhan melie echi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i barei agidene fenfulazhi ghua qieshenghala sozila giezho. Ingiedene, "Hheshi kien wine, yan shiqin giezho?" giezhi asazho. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Niezhan kunla ingiezhi onghonone, niezhan kunla qingiezhi onghonone. Ingiezhi noise qienfuzhan yan shiqin bikui mejie da, <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i laidene buduila sousan loude echi giezhi fenfulawo. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Louqi konde irese olon kunla hende jigheidazhi eghine giese buduila zinie <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i qienlie daowo. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Kunla khuina daghazhi, "Hhei ala!" giezhi waradazho.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Goyane Huiizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i buduila sousan lou sudoro lai orone giekude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> qienfuzhande asawo, "Bi chade nie aman kielien kieliese olunulie?" Hhe kieliewo, "Chi <char style="png">Xila</char> kielien kielie mejienu? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Chishi hhe oloncha daolon giedene 4000 shashoui uduruzhi hontande echisan hhe <char style="png">Aiji</char> kun pushoba?" <verse eid="ACT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Bishi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo. <char style="png">Jilijia</char>ni nie minshentu chenshi <char style="png">Dashu</char>ni hukouni bareizho. Bi chii xiahua gieye, mii bexinlade nie kielien kieliegha."<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Qienfuzhan tunyi oluse <char style="pn">Baolo</char> louqi jiere beidene bexinlade nie kha zhadeighase shenqi widawo. Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kielienghala kieliewo.<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>"Oqio kunla, gaijiula, bi goyane huizhi kieliesan kielienyi ta chenliendu." <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kielienghala kieliese hhela chenliedene genjia nanranshiwo. Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>"Bishi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo. <char style="png">Jilijia</char>ni <char style="png">Dashu</char>de oludene ene <char style="png">Yelusalen</char> chenshide fugiedazhi <char style="pn">Jiamalie</char>ni kha doura suruzho. Matanyi xienrenlani guijinyi chigharade suruzhi Hudade rexin wo. Edeku tanre niekielien wo. <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Bi eqighanse ene daolini daghasan kunlai heizhi fugughakude kuruwo. Ere kun, biereilai banlazhi bafanzide khawo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Ene shiqinde hhe nie zui fugie buwa, soyuji zui fugie fayenni zhanlaola man ganzhen bei shidane. Bi hhelai hhense xinni keredene <char style="png">Damashige</char>ni gaijiulai hhende echi, hhendedu xianxin giesan kunlai barei <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de lai echi faine giezho."<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Ezhanyi Xianxin Giesanyi Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>"Bi <char style="png">Damashige</char>de yozhi kurukude zhen zhunwu shihou wo. Menzhali asiman jierese fugie gonqi faizhi mii simiende zhouizho. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Bi zemin jiere fura bouse nie shenqi made kieliewo, '<char style="pn">Saolo</char>! <char style="pn">Saolo</char>! Chi mii yangiezhi heine?' <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Bi asawo, 'Ezhan, chishi kien wo?' Hhe kieliewo, 'Bishi chi heisan <char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo.' <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Mare hhantu yosan kunla hhe gonqii chanlawoma, made kieliesan shenqini sonosu dazho. <verse eid="ACT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>Bi kieliewo, 'Ezhan, bi matugiene?' Ezhan kieliewo, 'Bosidene <char style="png">Damashige</char>de echi. Hhende nie kun chi yan gieku shiqinni man kieliene.' <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Hhe gonqini gieghanghala bi sugho gholuwo. Hhantu yosan kunla mii khase laizhi <char style="png">Damashige</char>de orowo."<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>"Hhende nie kunyi niereiini <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> giene. Hheshi nie xienliantu kun wo, guijin jiere chighara wo. Hhende sousan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla man hhei zunzhun giezho. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>Hhe mii uzhele ire kanzidemi beidene <char style="pn">Saolo</char> gaijiu, chi chanla giezhi made kieliewo. Ingiekude bi nie uzhese hhei chanlawo."<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>"Ingie hhe kun kieliewo, 'Mai xienrenni Huda chii sunghudene goyane isii mejieghazhi hhe gou kunni chanlaghazhi shenqiini chenlieghawo. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Chi chanlasan, chenliesanne soyuji kunlai melie hhe kunde ganzhen beine. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Chi ede yan sagheizho? Bosidene Ezhanyi xiahua giezhi xilii jienliedene goya zuine waghazhi widagha.'"<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>"Khuinashi bi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khareidene mechide zhen onxian giekude zhoujin mutun nie ghudureqi chanlase <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Ezhan made kieliewo, 'Chi ghujighan <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se likai gie. Chi made beisan ganzhenni hhela ulie jienliene.' <verse eid="ACT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>Ingie bi kieliewo, 'Ezhan, eqighandei bi chii xianxin giesan kunlai bafanzide khazhi pse go huitanlade hhelai eghisei hhela goyane mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Pse chade ganzhen beisan <char style="pn">Siqifan</char>yi heizhi chusun usurukude biye kanzide beizhi tunyi giezhi hhei alasan kunlade oluzhi jienlaini uzhezhi ogizho.'"<verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>"Ingieliuzhe Ezhan made kieliewo, 'Chi echi, bi chii peizhi gholododu niman kunlai hhende echighane.'"<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Qienfuzhan Baolode Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Bexinla ene nie aman kielienyi chenliedene fugiede kieliewo, "Intu kunyi duya jierese widagha! Hheshi fugukuni wo!"<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Hhela izhi onghonozhi jienlane bendazhi turai asiman jiere khisigheise <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>qienfuzhan fenfulazhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i buduila sousan lou sudoro orogha, mabienzighala eghizhi kunla yangiezhi onghonosei asa giezho. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Eghine giezhi banlakude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kanzide beisan baifuzhande kieliewo, "Bishi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun wo. Zui ese jinjidene eghise falighala kieliese tande oluzhoye?" <verse eid="ACT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Ene kielienni chenliedene baifuzhan qienfuzhande echidene kieliewo, "Ene kunshi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun wo. Chi matugiene giezho?" <verse eid="ACT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Qienfuzhan ire <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de asawo, "Chi made kielie, chishi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun onu?" <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Enbene." <verse eid="ACT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Qienfuzhan kieliewo, "Bi olon baer huaizhi <char style="png">Loma</char> gojiani hukoude orowo." <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Bi olusanse enbene." <verse eid="ACT 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i eghizhi asane giesan kunla hhense deigo likai giewo. Qienfuzhan banlasan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>shi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun bikui mejiedene ayizho.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zui Fugie Fayen Melie Baolode Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Khuichudu qienfuzhan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i zhasan shiqinni mejiene giezhi hhei andaghadene fenfulazhi fugie buwa, zui fugie fayenni kunlai man hhantulaghasenu <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uduru ire hhelai melie beighawo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> zui fugie fayenni kunlai nudunne ese agi uzhezhi kieliewo, "Gaijiula, bi Hudai melie giekude lianxin ese ghudanduzhi izhi eli kuruwo." <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Ingie zui fugie buwa <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i kanzide beisan kunlade hhei aman jiere eghi giezhi fenfulawo. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhende kieliewo, "Chi ene mienzide khireisan kun, ghadane seighan wo, sudoro zannan wo. Huda chii eghine! Chi hhende souzhi guijinghala mii panjine giedene da guijinni fanjizhi mii eghi giezhi fenfulanu?" <verse eid="ACT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Kanzide beisan kunla kieliewo, "Chi lien Hudai zui fugie buwai sugienu?" <verse eid="ACT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Gaijiula, hheshi zui fugie buwa bikui bi mejie dawo. Bexinni gonjisan noyenne bu sugie giezhi jinwun jiere kieliezho."<verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai dundadu olieshi Sadugai kun, olieshi Falisai kun bikui uzhe khizhedene zui fugie fayenni kunlade fugiede kieliewo, "Gaijiula, bishi Falisai kun wo, Falisai kunni houdei wo. Bi fugusan kun fuho giekui xianxin giese made shenwun giezho." <verse eid="ACT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Ene kielienyi kieliese Falisai kun, Sadugai kunghala jianjidu qii kunla ghugha keiwo. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Yenlai Sadugai kunla kieliese qienxien, ruhher uwo, fuho gieku shiqinye uwo giezho. Falisai kun kieliese enela man wine giezho.<verse eid="ACT 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Kunla fugiede onghono qiiwo. Giedun Falisai paini jinwun hanjiala bosi ire hende jianjiduzho, "Ene kun yan codasei bijien ereizhi khizhe dawo. Kenen ruhher, qienxienla hhende kielien kieliezhoba." <verse eid="ACT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Ingie jianjiduzhi hendawo. Qienfuzhan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i sida zhazhazi gholughakuse ayizhi buduilai fenfula boughadene hhei qianla khizhe buduila sousan loude echigha giewo.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Hhe xii Ezhan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i kanzide beizhi kieliewo, "Chi danzine fugiedagha. Chi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de matugie made ganzhen beizhoshi <char style="png">Loma</char>deye qingiezhi ganzhen beikuni wo."<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yutai Kunla Baoloi Alakui Jihua Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Ogheidene <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla qioqioji shanlian giedene fayen giezhi kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Baolo</char>i ulie alatula matan ulie ijiene, ulie ochine." <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Ingiezhi hhantu fayen giesan kun 40 gie daozho. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Hhela fugie buwa, zhanlaolai shida echidene kieliewo, "Bijien <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i ulie alatula yama ulie ijiene giezhi fayen gie goudaghazho. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Ta ede zui fugie fayenni kunlare hhantu qienfuzhande kieliezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i tai enende uduru iregha. Jiazhon giezhi pse xianxide hhei shiqinni asane giezhi kielie. Bijien zhunbei gie goudazho. Hhe kuzhetula ala widaghane."<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i wishen hhela ghulazhi giesan jihuai sonosudene buduila sousan loude echi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> nie baifuzhanyi uruzhi ire kieliewo, "Chi ene nasuchighan kunyi udurudene qienfuzhanyi shida echi. Hhe hhende nie shiqin huibao giene." <verse eid="ACT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Ingiese baifuzhan hhei uduruzhi qienfuzhanyi shida echi "Bareisan <char style="pn">Baolo</char> mii uruzhi echi xiahua giezhi ene nie nasuchighan kunyi udurudene chade nie shiqin kielieghane." giezhi kieliese <verse eid="ACT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Qienfuzhan hhei khase laizhi niemiende echi asawo, "Chi made yan shiqin kieliene?"<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Hhe kieliewo, "<char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i shiqinde xianxide asane giezhi jiazhon giedene maghashijie hhei zui fugie fayende uduru iregha giezhi chii xiahua giekui shanlian gie goudawo. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Ingiese chi hhelanughunyi bu chenlie. <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i ulie alatula ulie ijiezhi ulie ochine giezhi fayen giesan 40 dogie kunla ede alane giezhi niuizho. Ede zhunbei gie goudazhi chii dain giekui sagheizho."<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Ingiese qienfuzhan nasuchighan kunde ene shiqinyi chi made kieliewo giezhi kiemade bu kielie giezhi fenfuladene hhei echighawo.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baoloi Feilisi Shenzhande Jiuizhi Ogizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Qienfuzhan ghua baifuzhanyi uru ire kieliewo, "200 gie yosan budui, 70 gie morei unusan budui, 200 gie zhida bareisan buduilai zhunbei gie. Ene xii 9 jiende <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de echine. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Pse morei zhunbei giezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i unughadene baohu giezhi <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> shenzhanni hhende khughozhi echigha." <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Hhe xin huaizhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>"<char style="pn">Kelaoji-Lixiya</char> <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> shenzhande kielien asazho. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Ene kunyi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla bareizhi alane giekude hheshi <char style="png">Loma</char> kun bikui bi mejiedene buduilai uduru echi hhei jiui khizhewo. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Hhela hhei yangiezhi zhasan shiqinyi bi mejiene giezhi hhei uduru hhelai zui fugie fayende echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Hhei zhasanshi zi hhelai jiomunni guijin jieredu shiqin bikui bi mejiewo. Yama fugughaku, banlaku zui uwo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Khuinashi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla hhei alane giesan jihuai nie kun made kieliese bi hhei deigo chii hhende ireghawo. Pse minlin xiaizhi hhei zhasan kun chii melie iredene zha giewo."<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Ingiese buduila zhao fenfulasan mutun xienidei <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uduru <char style="png">Anqipaji</char>de echighadene <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>khuichudu morei unusan buduila <char style="pn">Baolo</char>ni khughozhi echigha, yosan buduila sousan loudene khareiwo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Morei unusan buduila <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de ire xinni shenzhande ogisenu <char style="pn">Baolo</char>ni hhende jiuizhi ogiwo.'' <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Shenzhan xinni uzhe, <char style="pn">"Baolo</char>shi alinie shenni kun wo?" giezhi asadene <char style="png">Jilijia</char>ni kun bikui mejie kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>"Chii zhasan kunla irese panjiye." Ingie kunlade fenfulazhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i <char style="pn">Hherode</char> hongunde khawo.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yutai Kunla Baoloi Zhazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Tawudu daodene zui fugie buwa <char style="pn">Yananiya</char> giedun zhanlao, pse nie <char style="pn">Qietulo</char> giezhi lishire hhantu iredene shenzhande <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i zhazho. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uduru irese <char style="pn">Qietulo</char> hhei zhazhi kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Feilisi</char> fugie noyen, bijien chii yenyinghala chanqi nanrande udu daozhi chini melie uzheku aghelighala ene gojia fazhan giezhi goudazho. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Bijien suishisui chade hende mafan kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Bijien chii olon mafan ulie gieghane. Chii xiahua gieye, zhughene aghuidaghazhi bijienyi giedun aman kielienyi nie chenlie. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Bijien ene kunyi uzhese inzhaku gien niekielien wo. Qienxiani <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai shanjizhi londaghazho. Hheshi Nasale jiomunni nie touzi wo. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Mechini zannanshighane giese bijien hhei bareiwo. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Chi goyane ene kunyi shenwun giese bijien hhei zhasan shiqinlai man mejiene." <verse eid="ACT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla daghadene shiqin intui enbene giezhi hhei zhazhi kieliewo.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Feilisii Melie Goyane Huizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Shenzhan qiorun jienjizhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i kielie giese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Chi ene gojiade fayenni yenzhan haojinien danlasei bi mejiene. Ingiese bi bayasuzhi goyane huizho. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Bi libai giele <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khizhezhi 12 qienda ese olusei chi nie chaima mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Bi mechide kunlare jianjindusei, huitande, chenshini go oronlade kunlai shanjisei hhela chanlazhi ese daozho. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Hhela ede mii zhasan shiqinde chade yama zhenji ogi dane. <verse eid="ACT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>Ingiese bi chade nie shiqinni chenren gieye. Hhela xiejio wo giesan ene daolini bi daghazhi bijienyi xienrenyi Hudai beiizho. Guijinshu, xienzhini shu jiere jilasanyi man xianxin giezho. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Pse ene kunla xianxin giesan mutun gou kun, gou witu kunla man fuho giekui bi Hudase panjizho. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Ingiese bi Hudai melie, kunlai melie chan lianxin ulie ghudandune giezhi xiacha giezho. <verse eid="ACT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>Jinien daodene bi goya minzune nanxin kunlade baer khughozhi Hudade mure ogine giezhi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de irewo. <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Bi mechide ogine giezhi waghazhi ganjinrasei hhela chujieghewoma, olon kunlare hhantu uwo, daolonye ese giezho. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Zinie <char style="png">Yaxiya</char>se iresan giedun <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla hhende wo. Hhelade mii zhaku shiqin bise chii shida irezhi zhane. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Pse enezighan kunla bi zui fugie fayen melie bidene mii yan codasei mejiewoshi goyalane nie kielie gie. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Bi zinie hhelai dunda beizhi ene nie aman kielienyi fugiede kieliewo, 'Enedu tai melie made shenwun giekushi fugusan kun fuho giesan shiqin wo.'"<verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>
    <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> ene daolini xiandan qinchu wo. Ingie shenpanhuini danlazhi beighadene kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Lixiya</char> qienfuzhan bouzhese bi tai shiqinni panjiye." <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Ingiese baifuzhande fenfulazhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de ezighan ziyu ogizhi hhei uzhe giewo. Pse zhanlienlani hhende injiku dunxi ogise bu danla giezho.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Feilisi Baoloni Bafanzide Feilieghazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Giedudu daodene <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> biereighalane <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i ochirale irewo. Hhei biereishi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun wo. Niereini <char style="pn">Tuxila</char> giene. <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uruzhi iresenu <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani xianxin gieku daolii kielieghazhi chenliene giezho. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> gundande gieku, goyane kunzhi gieku, jianlai ireku shenpanni kieliese <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> hende ayidene kieliewo, "Chi xian echi, made fanbien winekude chii uruzhi ireye." <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/><char style="pn">Feilisi</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhende baer ogimu giezhi onxian giezhi hhei olonfa uruzhi ire kielien kielienduzho. <verse eid="ACT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Ghua hon gierudene <char style="pn">Boqiu-Feisidu</char> <char style="pn">Feilisi</char>ni oronde noyen danlawo. <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai bayasughane giezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i bafanzide kha jiezho.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Honshande Zhazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de noyen danlazhi ghurudu oludene <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khireiwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Hhende fugie buwa, <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni noyenla <char style="pn">Feisidu</char>de <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i zhazho. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/><char style="pn">Feisidu</char>i xiahua giezhi banman kerezhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de iregha giezho. Hhela mo jiere <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i alane giezhi jihua giezho. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/><char style="pn">Feisidu</char> kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Baolo</char>i ede <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de khazho. Bi deigo hhende echine giezho. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>Tai dunda qienlitu kun mare hhantu bousenu hhe kunde yan zui wineshi hhei zha."<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>
    <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> hhelai hhende neimudu, hharudu soudene <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de bouwo. Khuichudu hui keine giezhi shenpantai jiere soudene fenfulazhi <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uduru ire giewo. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> irese hhezighan <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>se bouzhesan <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla zhouwideni beizhi olon, gundu zuighala hhei zhazhoma, yama zhenji ogi dazho. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> goyane huizhi kieliewo, "Bugon <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunyi guijin, mechi, pse <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande bi zui fanjizhi ese daozho."<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>
    <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai bayasughane gie <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de asawo, "Chi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khireidene bi ene shiqinyi shenwun giese duran winu uwo?"<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Bi ede <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshanni shenpantai melie beizho. Enende made shenwun giese indanji wo. Bi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlade yama codasan shiqin giezhi ese daosei chiye qinchu wo. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Bi codasan shiqin giezhi fuguku zui wineshi fuguliuzhe made yama kieliekui uwo. Hhela mii zhasan shiqinshi zhenni pushoshi kiemada mii hhelade jiuizhi ogi dane. Bi <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande zhane."<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>
    <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> goya kunlarene shanlian giedene kieliewo, "Chi <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande zhase <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshanyi hhende echikuni wo."<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baoloni Yajipa Shida Echighazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Giedudu daodene <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshan <char style="pn">Beinisi</char>ghala <char style="png">Kaisaliya</char>de irezhi <char style="pn">Feisidu</char>de kielien asawo. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Hhende ezighancha soukude <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>ni shiqinyi <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshande kieliewo, "Enende nie fanren wine. <char style="pn">Feilisi</char> feilieghasan wo. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Bi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de bikude <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni fugie buwa, zhanlaola hhei shiqinyi made zhazhi, "Hhende zui jinji!" giezhi xiahua giewo. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Bi hhelade <char style="png">Loma</char> kunni falishi zhasan kun duifanghala ulie hhantulazhi duifande goyane huiku jihui ulie ogidene zui jinjise ulie olune giezhi kieliewo. <verse eid="ACT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>Ingiese hhela enende irese bi danwu ese giezhi khuichudu shenpantai jiere soudene fenfulazhi hhe kunyi uduru ire giewo. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Zhasan kunla beidene hhei zhase bi sumulasan qintu doghun shiqin pusho. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Hhela zinie goyai jiomunni shiqin jiere, pse fugusan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> giesan nie kunyi shiqin jiere jianjinduzho. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliese hhe kun amitu wo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Bi enei matugie chaikui mejie da, <char style="pn">"Baolo</char>de ene shiqinyi <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de khireidene shenwun giese duran winuwo?" giezhi asawo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> mii xiahua giezhi goyane feilieghadene <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshan jiejin gie giezho. Ingie bi hhei <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshanyi hhende khughozhi echighatula feiliegha giezhi fenfulawo."<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>
    <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> <char style="pn">Feisidu</char>de kieliewo, "Bi goyane ene kun kieliekui chenlieku duran wine." <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> kieliewo, "Maghashijie chi chenlie."<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Khuichudu <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> <char style="pn">Beinisi</char>ghala yoqi yoqi daqinde irewo. Qienfuzhan, hhe chenshini minshen fugietu kunlaiye deilazhi orowo. <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> nie fenfulase <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uduru irewo. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/><char style="pn">Feisidu</char> kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshan, pse enende bisan dajiala, ta uzhesan ene kunshijiu <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>ni, pse enendedu <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla man made fugiede waradazhi yoqiu giezhi hhei amitu feilieghase ulie olune giesan hhe kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Bi chaise hhende yama fuguku zui uwo. Pse hhe goyane <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande zhane giese bi hhei khughozhi hhende echighane giezhi jiejin giewoma, <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>ene kunyi xianxi shiqinyi <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande huaikui uwo. Ingie yama huaiku dunxi enende chaizhi olu shidanu gie, tai melie, yuqishi chi <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshanyi melie hhei uduru irewo. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Bi sumulase zhaku shiqinyi kieliezhi qinchu ulie olughadene fanrenni khughokude heshi uwo giezho."<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Yajipai Melie Goyane Huizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>
    <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de kieliewo, "Chi goyadene oluzhi kielie." Ingiese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> khane zhadeigha goyane huizhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>"<char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshan, <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla mii zhasan shiqinde enedu chii melie bi goyane huise mii inqi gou wo. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Tebieshi chi <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai xigon, jianjindukulai man shuxi wo. Ingiese bi chii xiahua gieye, chi rennai giezhi bi kieliesanyi chenlie."<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>"Bi meila shihouse izhi goya kun dundane <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de matugie giesei <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla man mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Bishi mai jiomun dundadu zui chigharadu Falisai paini nie goude giesan kun bikui hhela eqighanse mejiene. Enei hhela duran bise ganzhen bei shidane. <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Ede mii enende beigha shenwun giekushi Huda mai xienrenlade dain giesei bi panjiwo giezho. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Ene panjikushi mai 12 gie paini kunla xieni udu Hudai goude beiizhi ene dain giesei gholuse giesan hhe wo. Honshanya, ene nie panjiku yenyin jiere <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla mii zhazho. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Ta yale Huda fugusan kunlai aminne olughase xianxin giekui pusho giezho?"<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>"Shijishan bi goyane <char style="png">Nasale</char> kun <char style="pn">Ersa</char>i jinlianji fandui giese indanji wo giezhi sumuladene <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/><char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de ingiezhi giewo. Fugie buwalase qienli keredene shentulai bafanzide khazhi, da hhelai sixin panjikude beizhi bi tunyi oluwo. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Bi pse go huitanlade olonfa hhelai faizhi biidene <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni sugieghazho. Bi hhelade hende hokuzhi da niman kunlai chenshilade echizhi heizho."<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Ezhanyi Xianxin Giesei Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Tuj 9:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>"Ene mujighala bi fugie buwalase qienli, minlinni bareidene <char style="png">Damashige</char>de echine giezho. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Honshanya, zhunwude bi mo jiere yokude chanlase asimanse gon faizhi naranse da gieghan wo. Simiende bi, bighala hhantu yosan kunlai zhouizho. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Bijien man zemin jiere fura bouse nie shenqi <char style="png">Xibolai</char> kielienghala made kieliewo, '<char style="pn">Saolo</char>! <char style="pn">Saolo</char>! Yale mii heine? Chi fugherei mutun ezhanni eghesuntu teiyai qiuise goyane shanjine.'"<verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>"Ingiese bi kieliewo, 'Ezhan, chishi kien wo?' Ezhan kieliewo, 'Bishi chi heisan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> wo. <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Chi bosizhedene bei. Bi goyane chade xienjighakushi chii goyadene hoji danlaghazhi chi mii chanlasan shiqinde, pse bi chade jianlai xienjighaku shiqinde ganzhen beighane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Bi chii <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunlai, niman kunlai dundase jiuizhi khizhene. Bi chii peizhi hhelai hhende echighadene <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>nudunlaini keighazhi kharanise gon dunda ireghane. Ibilisii nenlise likai gieghazhi Hudade shunjighane. Ingiese mii xianxin giezhi zuini mienliedene zhiguitu gholusan kunlare hhantu guzide beighane.'"<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Giesan Wiliene Kieliezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>"<char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshanya, bi asimanse iresan zhoujin mutunyi shunjizhi <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>xien <char style="png">Damashige</char>de, pse <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de, <char style="png">Yudaya</char>ni go oronlade, niman kunlade chonjizhi geizhen giedene Hudade shunjizhi geizhen giesan shiqinne giezhi uzhegha giewo. <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Ene yenyin jiere <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla mechide mii barei agidene alane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Ingieliuzhe enedu kurutula Huda made banman giese bi enende beizhi undu kun boghoni kunliuzhe hhelade man ganzhen beizho. Xienzhila, <char style="pn">Musa</char> kieliezhi jianlai fashen giene giesan shiqinse chugo bi yama ese kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Hheshijiu Mexiha bixi shouku giedene fugusan kun dundase xien aminne oludene <char style="png">Yutai</char> kun, niman kunlade gonni mejieghane giesan wo."<verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> ingiezhi huise <char style="pn">Feisidu</char> fugiede kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Baolo</char>, chi fenjiulizho. Chii unhua texien undudase chii fenjiulighazho!"<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "<char style="pn">Feisidu</char> fugie noyen, bi uye fenjiulizho. Bi qinchude sumulasan daolini kieliezho. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Honshanye ene shiqinlai mejiene. Ingiese bi uye ayizhi hhende kieliezho. Ene shiqinni beimiende ese giezho, ingiese enelai noyende nieda mii dakui bi mejiene. <verse eid="ACT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/><char style="pn">Yajipa</char> honshanya, chi xienzhini xianxin gienu? Chi xianxin giekui bi mejiene."<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Ingiese <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>de kieliewo, "Chi intughanighala mii kieliezhi Mexihani tuji gholughanu?"<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Intughaniye olune, olonye olune. Chi, pse enedu enende chenliesan kunla man bi mutun gholuse giezhi bi Hudase onxian giezho, zinie bi mutun jieliu bu zho giezho."<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Ingiese honshan, shenzhan, <char style="pn">Beinisi</char>, pse sousan kunlare bosizhedene <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>khuina dao echi nieniedene kieliezho, "Ene kun fuguku, khaku zui ese fanjizho."<verse eid="ACT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Ingiedene <char style="pn">Yajipa</char> <char style="pn">Feisidu</char>de kieliewo, "Ene kun <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande ese zhazhoshi eqighan andaghawo."<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Baolo Lomade Echiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Bijienni chon soughazhi <char style="png">Idali</char>de echighane giezhi jiejin giese hhela <char style="pn">Baolo</char>, psedu fanrenlai hongun buduilani nie baifuzhande jiuizhi ogiwo. Niereini <char style="pn">Yuliu</char> giene. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Niekozi <char style="png">Yadamiqien</char>se iresan chon <char style="png">Yaxiya</char> oronni haibienzighun yone giezho. Bijien hhe chon jiere khirei yowo. Bijienre hhantu yosanshi <char style="png">Maqidun</char>ni <char style="png">Qiesalonijia</char> kun <char style="pn">Yalidagu</char> wo.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Khuichudu <char style="png">Xidun</char>de kuruwo. <char style="pn">Yuliu</char> <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i danren giezhi zhanlienlaini uzheghale echise zhanlienlani <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i zhaogu giezho. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Hhense chonni keizhi qiise kei shun uwoshi bijien keini piizhi <char style="png">Saipulusi</char>yi beimienghun yozho. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Bijien <char style="png">Jilijia</char>, <char style="png">Panfeiliya</char>ni meliedu haini daodene <char style="png">Lijia</char>ni <char style="png">Meila</char>de kuzhewo. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Hhende niekozi <char style="png">Idali</char>de echine giesan <char style="png">Yalishanda</char>ni chonni penjise baifuzhan bijienyi hhe chon jiere khireighawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Lienjizhi giedudu chon yozhi tanshi kuzhe dazhi ingiezhi cai <char style="png">Genitu</char> bienzide kuzhewo. Kei bijienyi jiohoro giese <char style="png">Samoni</char>ni bienzise keini piizhi <char style="png">Kelitedao</char> douraghun yozho. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Bijien bienzighun yose chon yozhi chijia no wo. Ingie cai <char style="png">Laxiya</char> chenshini kouisan <char style="png">Seighan Haibienzi</char> giezhi nie oronde irewo.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Oloncha shijien danwu giezhi orozo bareiku shihou ijin daose pse chon keizhi wixiennudawo. Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kunlade sughazhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>"Dajiala, bi uzhese enefa chon keizhi wixien no wo. Zinie ho, chonni qida olughaku pusho, matan aminne da gui dane." <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Baifuzhan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i kielienni ese chenliezhi chon keisan kun, chonni ezhanyi kielienyi chenliezho. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Ene haibienzide uncha daoghaku chijia wo. Ingiese dabufen kunla hhense likai giezhi <char style="png">Feinike</char>de echidene uncha daoghaye giezhi jiejin giewo. <char style="png">Feinike</char>shi <char style="png">Kelitedao</char>ni nie haibienzi wo. Niemienni xinan miende wo, niemienni xibei miende wo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hai Jiere Fugie Keini Penjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Ene shihoude nanbangiese ga kei bosiwo. Hhela sumulase zhao jihuaghala yose olune giezhi chon beighaku gougoui khizheghadene <char style="png">Kelitedao</char>i kouizhi yozho. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Oloncha ese beidene nie honfenkei <char style="png">Kelitedao</char> bienzise feilie irewo. Hhe honfenkeini nierei Dunbeifen giene. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Chonni kei wiqi agise pse melie yo da, keini dagha yozho. <verse eid="ACT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Nie ga daoni nierei <char style="png">Gaoda</char> giene. Bijien ene daoni kanzighun keini piizhi yozho. Khuina laisan ga chonni beigha dazhi ingiezhi beighawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Ga chonni laizhi khizhedene zhashighala fugie chonni zhouwini banla goudaghawo. <char style="png">Saierji</char>ni usu douradu shazide guai feilieghakuse ayizhi chon jieredu fugie popui bouzhegha chonni durare yoghawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Bijienyi kei, lan izhi biidene jindaghase khuichudu hhela holai haide bendawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Pse niudu daosenu hhela chonde injisan dunxilai qinsi bendawo. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Hao giedudu naran, hodunyi chanla dawo. Honfenkei bijienyi biise bijienyi jiuiku xiwon widawo.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Kunla giedudu yama ese ijiezho. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai dunda beidene kieliewo, "Dajiala, ta mini kielienyi indan chenliekui wo. <char style="png">Kelitedao</char>se likai ese giewoshi imeghei sunshiji qida olukui uwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Ede bi tande kielieye, ta zhughene tei. Tai kiemai amin nieda ulie widane, zinie chon widane. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Mii gonjisan, bi beiisan Hudai qienxien uzhughu xii mii kanzide beizhi kieliewo, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>'<char style="pn">Baolo</char>, bu ayi. Chi kenjin <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshanyi melie beine. Huda chighala hhantu chon sousan kunlade pinnan ogine.' <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Ingiese dajiala, zhughene tei. Huda made matugiezhi kieliese qintui gholukui bi xianxin giene. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Matanyi nie haini dao jiere guai feilieghane."<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>14 qien kurudene xienidei chon <char style="png">Yadeliyahai</char> jiere hheliezhi eneman hheman giezho. Chabudu banyedei chon jieredu wiliechila zemin jiere chadashiwo gie, <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>jiochighala nie nanjise gunde 12 zhan wo. Melie gouji yodene pse nie nanjise 9 zhan wo. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Hhela chon tashi jiere mughukuse ayizhi chon boghose jieran chon beighaku gougoui boughadene ogheikui panjizho. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Wiliechila chon beighaku gougoui chon qiorunse boughazho giezhi yanzi gie, ga chonni usude bougha, holuku muji daizho. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> baifuzhan, buduilade kieliewo, "Enezighan kunla chon jiere ulie feiliese ta aminne gui dane." <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Ingiese buduila ga chonni zhashii chizhi siragha anda boughawo.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Ogheikude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> ashighalade ijiuni ijie giezhi sughazhi kieliezho, "Ta izhi yama ese ijiezhi enedushi 14 qien oluwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Ingiese bi tande sughazhi kielieye, ta gouji ijie. Ene tai aminni jiuine. Tai kiemadai nieganzi usunye ulie widane." <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Ingie <char style="pn">Baolo</char> ene kielienyi kieliedene ginanyi barei ashighalai melie Hudade mafan kieliedene ghulu ijiewo. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Ingie hhela man zhughene teizhi ijiewo. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Bijien chon jiere 276 gie kun wo. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Hhela ijie chududene chonni gongiereghane giezhi boudeilai haide bendawo.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chonni Guaidene Gha Olughazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Ogheisenu hhela hhe oronyi tani dawoma, nie haibienzii chanlawo. Ingie chonni jinlianji bienzide echighane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Ingie jiesunyi chizhi siragha chon beighaku gougoui haide boughawo. Fanxian kunzhi gieku doni sularaghazhi popui lai khireighase zhao keizhe bienzide echiwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Lianmienni usu hhantulasan shazitu oronde chonni qiorunyi jiai beighawo. Lan chon boghoi eghi qida olughawo.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Ingiekude fanrenla unba holu widakuse ayizhi buduila hhelai alane giezho. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Baifuzhan <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i jiuine giezhi hhelai ingiezhi ese gieghawo. Ingie fenfulazhi unba mejiechen kunla usude jioli bou, xien bienzide khirei giewo. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Psedu kunla banba, chon jieredu dunxighala bienzide khirei gie wo. Ingiezhi dajialai jiuizhi usu bienzide khireiwo.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Maerta Dao Jiere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Bijien pinnande bienzi jiere khirei, ene daoni <char style="png">Maerta</char> giekui mejiewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Hhe oronyi kunla bijiende gou no wo. Hhende ghura bouzhi qienqi kuiqienshi khan sideraghazhi bijienyi zhaogu giewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> ezighan muzhai qiangu ire khande teise nie mogheii tulie bazilie da, holu khizhe <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i khaini jinji beizho. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Hhe oronyi kunla moghei hhei kha jiere horo beisanyi chanladene nieniedene kieliezho, "Ene kunshi kenjin nie sharenfan wo. Haise jiui khizhewoma, asiman hhei aminne ulie olughane." <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> mogheini khande benda oroghawoma, shan ese deilazho. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Hhela sumulase hhe khaitumu, pse zemin jiere fura boudene fugumu giezho. Oloncha sagheise yama uye giesei chanladene kharei hheshi nie huda wo giezho.<verse eid="ACT 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Hhe shida nie ghazha wine, dao jieredu zui fugie noyen <char style="pn">Bubailiu</char>nughun wo. Hhe bijienyi jienliezhi shixinji ghurudu zhaodai giewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Ingiekude <char style="pn">Bubailiu</char>ni adani fashao giezhi xieli kudene kijiezho. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> orozhi echi onxian giezhi hhei jiere khane teiwo. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Ingiese dao jieredu gientulaye irezhi man goudaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Hhela bijienyi hende danren giezhi bijien yokude mo jiere injiku dunxilai chon jiere khughozhi ogiwo.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Lomade Kuruzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Dao jiere ghuran sara beidene bijien nie <char style="png">Yalishanda</char>se iresan chon jiere khirei yo qiiwo. Ene chonshi haini dao jiere uncha daoghasan wo, qiorun jiereni <char style="pn">Shongo</char> giesan hao teizho. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Bijien <char style="png">Xilagu</char>de kurudene ghurudu beiwo. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Pse hhense raoizhi <char style="png">Lijiwun</char>de echiwo. Niudu daose nanbangieni kei bosise khuichudu <char style="png">Bujiuli</char>de kuruwo. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Hhende ezighan gaijiulai ochiradene bijienyi xinlazhi echi hhelare hhantu doludu souwo. Bijien ingiezhi <char style="png">Loma</char>de kuzhewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Hhendedu gaijiula bijienyi xioxini sonosudene <char style="png">Loma</char>se <char style="png">Yabiwu</char> geidoude, pse <char style="png">Ghuran Lishe</char> giesan ime gholo oronde bijienyi jienliele irewo. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> hhelai chanladene Hudade mafan kieliezhi danzi fugiedawo. <verse eid="ACT 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Bijien <char style="png">Loma</char>de kuruse <char style="pn">Baolo</char>i uzhesan nie buduighala danxin soukui tunyi oluwo.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baolo Lomade Daoli Chonjizho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Ghurudu daodene <char style="pn">Baolo</char> <char style="png">Yutai</char> kunni lindaolai uruzhi irewo. Hhela irese <char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliewo, "Gaijiula, bi goya kunlane, xienrenlai guijinni fandui gieku shiqin uye giezhoma, mii <char style="png">Yelusalen</char>de bareizhi <char style="png">Loma</char> kunde jiuizhi ogiwo. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Hhela mii shenwun giezhi yama fuguku zui ereizhi olu dadene mii andaghane giese <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/><char style="png">Yutai</char> kunla fandui giezhi made banfa widadene <char style="pn">Kaisa</char> honshande zhawo. Bi goya kunlane zhane ese giezho. <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Ingiese bi tai xinlazhi ire danmien kielieye giezho. Bi <char style="png">Isilie</char> kunla panjisan hhe kunyi yenyin jiere ene qieshenyi zhozho."<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Ingiese hhela kieliewo, "Bijien <char style="png">Yudaya</char>se chii kieliesan xinni jienliezhi ese daozho. Gaijiula dundaye kiema chii zhazhi yama huaini kieliezhi ese daozho. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Ingieliuzhe bijien chii ijien matugiezho giezhi chenlieku duran wine. Ene jiomunni kunla gochude fandui giekui bijien mejiene."<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Ingiese hhela udu jinjidene olon kunla <char style="pn">Baolo</char> sousan oronde irewo. <char style="pn">Baolo</char> eqiemaghase khara olutula hhelade Hudai gojiai daolii jianjizhi ganzhen beizho. <char style="pn">Musa</char>ni shu, xienzhilai shughala <char style="pn">Ersa</char>ni shiqinyi kieliezhi shundaghawo. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/><char style="pn">Baolo</char> kieliesan kielienyi chenliedene niezhanla xianxin giewo, niezhanla xianxin ese giewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Hhelai ijien kiemai ijien buxianshi sandane giekude <char style="pn">Baolo</char> nie aman kielien kieliewo, "Shenlin <char style="pn">Isaiya</char> xienzhii tungo giezhi tai xienrenlade kieliesan kielien ese codazho,<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>'Chi echidene ene bexinlade kielie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">'Ta izhi chenliezhoma, dunjire dane.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">Ta izhi uzhezhoma, minbai olu dane.<verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Ene bexinlai zhughe khiduzhezhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">chighin beidazhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">nudunne hameizho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Pse nudunni chanlazhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">chighinni sonosuzhi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">zhughedeni minbai oludene kharei daorese</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">Bi hhelai goudaghakuse ayizho.<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>Ingiese ta mejiendu. Huda ene jiuiku daolini niman kunlade chonjizhi ogiwo. Hhelaye chenliene."<verse eid="ACT 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>
    <char style="pn">Baolo</char> goya bouisan giedene ghua hon souzhi hhei ochirale iresan kunlai man jienliewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Hhe zui fugie danzighala Hudai gojiai daolii jianjizhi Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani shiqinyi kunlade sughase danlachen kun uwo.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
